<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="2SA" style="id">2 Samuel</book>
  <para style="h">2 Samuel</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Samuel</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Samuel</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Samuel</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Saul shi nua in hichi ahing hia, David Amalekte va sim gal zou a ahing kinuale kia in, David Ziklag ah ni ni a um a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ani thum niin hichi ahing hia, ngaiin mi khat Saul panmun akipat in, apuonte kibottel gawp leh alutunga a leivui bang niainuai in ahing pei a, tualeh hichi ahia, David kunga ahing tun tahin lei a khupboh in chibai abuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh David in akungah, “Hei a hing kipan na hiei?” achi hi. Tuachi’n aman akungah, “Israelte pan mun akipat a hing suohta ka hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh David in akungah, “Bangthu a um ei? hing hil in,” achia, tualeh aman adawnga, “Kidouna ah mipite ataizah ua, mipite lah ah tampi apua ua ashi uhi, tualeh Saul leh atapa Jonathan zong ashi uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n David in ama hil tangvalpa kungah, “Bangchidan a Saul leh atapa Jonathan ashi uh chi na thei ahiei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh ama hing hil tangval pan, “Bang chidan ahiei in Gilboa muol ah kava um kha laizanga, tuanah Saul ateipi a kingam in aum a; tualeh ngai in. Sakolleng leh sakol tungtuong miten ama ahing delkhawm ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Anua lang ahing et leh kei ahing mu a, ahing han a, tualeh ken, Tanah ka um hi chi’n ka dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh aman ka kungah, koi na hiei? ahing chi a, tualeh ken Amalek mi ka hi chi’n kadawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh aman kei kungah, ka kungah hing ding inlen hing thatsuh mai in shi dinga chimawnain ahing buohkhumta a, ka hinna lah aum nalai veu vou a, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n akungah ka dinga, tuabanga puase gawpsa adamzou nawn sih ding chi ka theichien ziehin ka thatta hi. Tualeh a alutunga amanglukhu leh aban tuomna tau kala a, kapu kungah ka hing tawi hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n David in apuonsilte abotkehta a, tualeh akunga um zousie’n zong tuabangin abawl uhi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh Saul leh atapa Jonathan leh Mangpa mite leh Israel innkuonte asuun ua, akap ua, nitah tandongin ann angawl uhi, namsau a thalia ahi zieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh David in ama hil tangvalpa kungah, “Heilang mi na hiei?” achia, tualeh aman adawnga, “Kei gamdang mi Amalekmi tapa kahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh David in akungah, “Mangpa sathaunu that dinga atunga khut na hah, bangchidan a chizalou na hiei mah?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n David in tangval khat ahan a akungah “Zuonphei inlen satlia in,” achi hi. Tualeh ava sat a ashita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n David in akungah, “Na sisan maw nangma lutungah um heh, aziehpen Mangpa sathaunu ka thatta hi chi nangma kam ngel in apuongta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n David in Saul leh atapa Jonathan tam kala in a awi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh tam Thalpi la, Juda tate hil dingin mi asawl a; Ngai in, Jasher laibu ah akigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Aw Israel na kilawmna na munsangte ah athat ua, Bangchidan ahiei, miliente apua mai uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Gath ah gensih unlen, Ashkelon kholaiah phuong sih un, Khuchilouin vang Philistin tanute akipah ding ua, teptanlou tanute nuomsa in akikou kha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Nou Gilboa muolte aw, na tung uah Daitui ke sih henlen, guo zong zu sih henlen, sillat dingte zong poudoh sih heh. Tuamun ah mihat, lum leh phaw kidahhuoitah in apaita ua, Saul lum leh phaw zong, sathau nulou banga paimang ahita.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Mi kithatte sisan akipat leh mihatte tahsa akipat, Jonathan thal anuakia ngai sih a, tualeh Saul namsau zong aguohin akinuale kia ngai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Saul leh Jonathan hindan lah adeihuoi in akilawm ua, tualeh ashi un zong akikhen sih ua, mipite sangin ahatzaw ua, humpibahneite sangin zong ahat zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Nou Israel tanute aw, Saul sun unlen kap un, Puonsandup kilawmtahte ahing silsah a, na puonsilte u’tungah sana a kizepnate, ahing baat pieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Kidouna kim laitah a, mi hatte apua taah mai uh; “Aw Jonathan, na mun sangte a tha a na umtah mai!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka lung azing hi na tung thu ah, Aw ka unaupa Jonathan; ka tungah na hoi mama a, Nang itna alam dang a; Numei itna akhup hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Mi hatte bangchidan a pua a kidouna galvante amanthaitah mawh;” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh tamte nua in hichi ahia, David in “Mangpa adonga, Judate khopi lah a khat ah ka peitou diei?” achi hi. Tualeh Mangpa’n “Peitou in” achi hi. Tualeh David in “Heipen ah ka peitou diei?” achia, tualeh Mangpa’n “Hebron khuo ah,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n David khunah apeitoua, tualeh azite gel, Jezereel mi Ahinoam leh Karmel mi Nabal zi Abigail zong azawpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />David in akunga um mite zousie apuitou a, michin a innkuonpite chiet utoh, tuachi’n Hebron leh a khopi te ah atengta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n Juda mite ahing pei ua, Juda mite tunga leeng dingin David sathau anuta uhi. Tualeh amaun “Saul vui mite Jabesh-Gilead mite ahi uh” chi’n David ahil uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n David in Jabesh-Gilead mite kungah mi asawl a, akung uah, “Na pu uh Saul na hepina uh na sulang ua, nana vui ziehun Mangpa’n hing guolzawlta hen, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n na tung uah hepina leh thutah langsah henlen, tualeh tambang silte na bawl ziehun ken zong tambang hepina na tung uah ka hing thuh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuin na khutte uh hatsahin um henlen hangsan tahin um un, na pu uh Saul ashitah ziehin Juda miten atung ua leeng dingin sathau ahing nuta uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khumbangkal ah Ner tapa Abner, Saul galkap lamkaipa’n, Saul tapa Ishbosheth khu Mahanaim tan dong apui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Gilead tungah, Ashur tungah, Jezereel tungah, Ephraim tungah, Benjamin tungah, tualeh Israel nam zousie tungah leengpa in abawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Saul tapa Ishbosheth khu Israelte tunga vai ahawm pat lai in kum sawmli a upa ahia, tualeh kum ni sung vai ahawm hi. Hinanleh Juda miten David azui zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh David in Hebron a Juda innkuonte tunga avaihawm hunsung kum sagi leh haguh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh Ner tapa Abner leh Saul tapa Ish-bosheth suohte khu Mahanaim akipat apawtkhie ua, Gibeon ah apeita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh Zeruiah tapa Joab leh David suohte zong akuondoh ua, Gibeon dil ah akituoh ua, tuachi’n dil gal langkhat ah pawlkhatte atou ua tualeh dilgal lelam pangah lawi khatte a tou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n Abner in Joab kungah, “Tangvalte hing kisa u’henlen imasang ah hing kisattuo u’heh” achi hi. Tualeh Joab in “Kisa u’leh asih diei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n Saul tapa Ishbosheth lam a pang Benjamin nam a mi sawm leh ni tualeh David mite sawm leh ni ma akisa ua, agal kaita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh akituohpi alangpa chiet utoh alu uah akiman ua, namsau in akidawt tuo chiet ua, apuakhawm chiet uhi, tuaziehin khum mun min Helkath-Hazurim achi uhi, tuakhu Gibeon a um ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n tuani a kidouna khu ahuoise mama a, Abner leh Israel mite khu David leh amite masangah aguollelta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuanah Zeruiah tapa thumte, Joab, Abishai leh Asahel a um uhi, tualeh Asahel khu gam sazuhpi bangmai a ngalhat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n Asahel in Abner anuadela, zietlam ahiei veilam ahiei a, piellou kei in Abner adel vevaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n Abner akinuahei a, akungah, “Asahel na hiei?” achi a, tualeh aman “Ka hi nahi,” chi’n adawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh Abner in akungah, “Na zietlam ahiei, na veilam ahiei ah kihei inlen, tangval khat man inlen agalvan lahpiehin,” achi hi. Hinanleh Asahel in ama adel a, akiheisan nuomsih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n Abner in Asahel kungah, “Hing kiheisanin, bang dinga hing sunlia a lei lah a hing puasah ding ka hiei mah? Na sanggampa Joab mel bang kachi mungam nawn diei mah?” achi kia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hinanleh aman akiheisan nuom sih a, tuaziehin Abner in atei tong lamin agil ah ana dawt a, a lelam ah apaileta, tualeh tuamun ah apua a, ashita hi. Tualeh hichi ahia, Asahel pua a, ashina mun a hing peikha pouma adinkhawl zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Joab leh Abishai in zong Abner anuadel ua, tualeh Gibeon gamdai lampi a Giah phah masang a um Ammah muol aphah lai un ni atumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachi’n Benjamin mite Abner kungah ahing kikhawm ua, pawlkhat in ahing kibawl ua, tualeh muolvum ah ava dingta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuachi’n Abner in Joab ahan a, akungah, “Namsau a kidou kumtawn ding ihiei mah? atawp na khu kimudana khat ahi ding chi na thei sih amah? mipite a unaute uh anuadelna ua kipat a nuakia dinga hillou a bangtan vei ahiei na um ding?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh Joab in akungah, “Pasian hinna lou in kagen ahi, bangma na genlou hilachin, mipiten a unaute uh anuadel uh zingmawng a tawpsanta ding hi ua,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joab in pengkul amut a, tuachi’n mipite zousie adin khawl chiet ua, Israelte anuadel nawnsih ua, dou zong adou nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuachi’n Abner leh amite zan khovah in phaijang tawn in apei suoh ua, tualeh Bithron akaantan ua, Mahanaim atung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joab zong Abner anuadelna apat anua kiata a, tualeh mipi zousie ahing kikhopkhawm u’leh David mite sawm leh kuo leh Asahel akimta sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hinanleh David miten, Benjamin mi, Abner mite zathum leh sawm guh athat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuachi’n Asahel luong ala ua, Bethlehem a um apa han ah avuita uhi. Tualeh Joab leh amite zan tungtawn in apei ua, Hebron atun un, khuo avah hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Saul innkuonte leh David innkuonte, sawtpi akidou ua, hinanleh David ahat deu deu a, tualeh Saul innkuonte ahatmaw deu deu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />David in Hebron ah tapate anei a, ata masapen Amnon ahia, Jezreel mi Ahinoam in ahinpieh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh anina khu Karmel mi Nabal zi Abigail in ahinpieh Kileab ahi a, tualeh athumna khu Geshur leengpa Talmai tanu Maakah tapa Absalom ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh alina khu Haggith tapa Adonijah ahia, angana khu Abital tapa Shephatiah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aguhna khu David zi Eglah in ahinpieh Ithream ahi. Tamte khu Hebron a pieng David tate ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing ahi a, Saul innkuonte leh David innkuonte kikaal a kidouna aum sungin Abner in Saul innkuon sung a apan mun asuhat semsem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh Saul in mei khat anei a, amin Rizpah ahia, Aiah tanu ahi. Tualeh Ishbosheth in Abner kungah, “Bangchidan a ka pa meinu nava luppi ahiei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ishbosheth thugen in Abner alungthahsah mama a, tualeh akungah, “Kei Judate langa pang ui lutang ka hiei mah? Tuni tandonga napa Saul innkuonte tung leh a unaute tung leh a lawi aguolte tung ah gin umna ka sulanga, David khut sung ah ka hing pe sih a, hinanleh nangman tuni’n tam numei tunga khiel dingin na hing ngawh mawha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mangpa David kunga ana kichiemnate bangbanga ka bawl a ka tangtun sah sih leh Pasian in Abner tungah alaw law, law henlen, tua sanga thupi zaw in zong bawl heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Dan apata Beer-sheba tandonga Saul innkuonte apat leenggam lehei a, Israel leh Judate tunga David mangtoupha suhkip dingin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh azau mama ziehin kam khat in zong Abner adawng ngam sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh Abner in ama thahengin David kungah mi asawl a, “Tam gam koi a ahiei? ava chi sah a, tualeh ka kungah thuhun bawl inlen, tuachi’n ngai in, Israel mi zousie nangma lam a pang dingin, ka hing panpi ding achisah nalai hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />David in “Ahoi hi, na kungah thuhun kabawl ding, hinanleh sil khat ka hing phut ding hi, tua khu tami ahi, ahing kimupi dinga na hing pei chieng Saul tanu, Mikal nang zawpi sihleh ka mel na muthei sih ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n David in Saul tapa Ishbosheth kungah “Ka zi Mikal Philistin mite tepvun zakhat a ka leisa khu hing pie in,” chi’n mi asawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh Ishbosheth in mi asawl a, pasal Laish tapa Paltiel kunga kipat in ava ladoh sahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n apasal in lam tungtawn in kap kawm in Bahurim tandong azui a, tuachi’n Abner in akungah “Nua peikia tain” achi a; anuakia ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh Abner in Israel upate ahoupi a, “Tumasanglai in David na tung ua leeng dingin nana dei ua:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n tuin pangsah ta un, Mangpa’n David tungthu ah, ka suohpa David zangin ka mi Israelte Philistin mite leh amelmate uzousie apat in ka hundam ding hi, chi’n ana genta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh Abner in Benjamin namte zah in zong a gen a, tuachi’n Abner in Israelte leh Benjamin innkuonte zousie in hoi asah dan uh, Hebron a David zah a vagen dingin apei ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n Abner in Hebron khuo a, David kung ah mi sawmni toh ava pei a, tualeh David in Abner leh azawpite adingin annkuong alui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n Abner in David kungah, “Ka dingdoh dinga, na kunga thu ahun theina ding u’leh na deitel na bang tah a vai na hawm theina dingin Israel mi zousie ka pu leengpa kunga khawmkhawm dingin ka va kuon ding,” achi hi. Tualeh David in Abner akuonsah ta a, tuachi’n lungmuong tahin akuonta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuazou in, David mite leh Joab galdouna muna pat a hing kinuale ahing tung ua, gallah van tampi ahing tut uhi; Hinanleh Abner khu Hebron a David kungah aum nawn sih hi; David in ana sawldoh a, ama zong lungmuong tahin ana peita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Joab leh akunga azawpi galkap zousie ahing tun tah un, “Ner tapa Abner leengpa kungah ahing haw a, tualeh aman ana peisah kia ta a, ama zong lungmuong tahin apeita hi,” chi’n Joab ahil uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joab leengpa kungah ahing pei a, akung ah, “Nasil bawl bang chi dan ahiei? Ngai in Abner na kung ah ahing haw a, bangdinga na sawldoh a, na nua peisah kia ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ner tapa Abner na thei a, nangma sol dingin, na vaikuon leh na vaitun thei tum leh na sil bawl zousie thei tum a hing haw ahibou hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh David kunga kipata Joab ahing pawt in Abner nuadel dingin mi asawl a, Sirah tuikhuh akipat in ahing nuazawpi kia ua, hinanleh David in tuabang agamtatnate uh athei kha sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh Abner Hebron a ahing nuatun kia tahin, Joab in kulpi kotkhah pulam ah houpi dingin azawpi tuom a, asanggampa Asahel sisan phuba lahna in agil ah adawt a ashita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tualeh anua a David in tamthu azah tahin “Kei leh ka leenggam in Ner tapa Abner shina tungtang ah Mangpa mai ah ka siengthou kumkhuo ding uhi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Joab lutung leh apa innkuonpite zousie tung ah kibungta heh Joab innkuonte lah ah sipawt ahiei, phah ahiei, chiengkhut tunga kingam a um ahiei, namsau a tha ahiei, nehletah kitasamlou in um sih heh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuachi’n Gibeon a kidouna a, asanggampa uh Asahel atha ziehin Joab leh asanggampa Abishai in Abner athat ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuachi’n David in Joab leh akunga um mipite zousie kungah, “Na puonte uh botkeh unlen sai ip puon sil unlen, Abner sun un,” achi hi. Tualeh leengpa David in aluong azui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuachi’n Abner Hebron ah avui ua, tualeh leengpa’n aw ngaitah suo in Abner han ah akapta a, tualeh mipi zousie zong akap uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa’n Abner a kaa a, “Akaa tengin Abner mi maw shi banga shi ding ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Na khut lah kan ahisih a, Na keng zong kolbu lah ahi sih a, Migilou masanga mi apua bangin,” Nang zong na puata mawh a, achi hi. Tuachi’n mi zousien Abner akaa chietta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tualeh sun ahi lai in mi zousie David ann ne sah dingin ahing pei ua, hinanleh nitum masanga ann ahiei, sil dang mawngmawng ahiei, aneh a ka neh tahleh, “Pasian in alaw law hing law heh, tuasanga thupi zaw in zong,” chiin David akichiemta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Mipi zousie in tuathu athei un akipah mama uhi, leengpa sil bawl pouma in mipite akipah sah zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tuachi’n mipi zousie leh Israel mite zousie in, tua ni in Ner tapa Abner kitha khu leengpa thu a kithat ahisih chi atheita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa’n amite kungah, “Tuni’n Israelte lah a mi lien leh mithupi mama khat ashita chi theilou na hi uoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Lengpa dinga sathau nu hinanleng zong tuni’n ka hat zou sih hi. Tualeh tam Zeruiah tapate haw, kei a dingin thuoh ha hina va-ia uh e, Mangpa’n sil hoilou bawl mi agitlouna uh dung zui in thuhta heh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Saul tapa Ishbosheth in Hebron ah Abner ashita chi ana zah tahin akhutte ahing hat nawn sih a, tualeh Israelte zousie zong alung keta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuin Saul tapa in galkap lamkai ni anei a, khat min Baanah ahia adang khatpa min Rekab ahi. Benjamin hahlesuon Beeroth khuo ami Rimmon tapate ahi uhi (Beeroth khu Benjamin gam a um a ngai ahi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh Beeroth mite khu Gataim ah atailut ua, tuni dongin khunah aumdenta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Saul tapa Jonathan in tapa a keng langni a bai anei a, Jezreel a kipata Saul leh Jonathan tanchin ana kithei lai in, kum nga a upa ahia, tuachi’n ama ching nuin apom a ataimang pi a, tualeh hichi ahi a, taimang dinga akintat nalam ah akesah a, akeng ahing baita hi. Amin Mephibosheth ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Beeroth mi Rimmon tapate Rekab leh Baanah ava kuon ua, Ishbosheth inn ah sun nisat laitahin ava tung ua, ama khu a lupna tungah ana sun lup hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bu vala ding hi u’leh kilawm in innsung tawng lam ah ava lut ua, tualeh agil ah adawt ua, tuachi’n Rekab leh asanggampa Baanah ataimangta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Inn sunga ava lut laitah un alupna pindan a lupna tungah ana lum a; tuachi’n ava dawtlia ua, alu atan ua, tualeh alutang apuo ua, Arabah kantan in zan tungtawn in apei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh Ishbosheth lutang khu Hebron a David kungah ahing tawi ua, leengpa kungah, “En in, Nang hing thatum na melmapa Saul tapa Ishbosheth lutang ahi, Mangpa’n ka pu leengpa phuba tuni’n Saul leh ahah asuonte tungah alahpiehta hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n David in Beeroth mi Rimmon tapate Rekab leh asanggampa Baanah a dawnga, akung uah, “Ka melmate zousie lah a pat a hing tanpa Mangpa min lou in ka gen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi khat in thupha hing tut a kingaituo in, Ngai in Saul ashita chiin ahing hil a, amapa ka man a Ziklagah ka that hi, aman lah athupha puoh zieh a, bang ahiei kipahman ka pieh dingin akigingta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi dihtat ama innsunga alupna tung ngel a lumlai migilou in atha uh sisan man na tung uah ka hing phut nasa zaw hi, lei tunga kipat in ka hing sumang nasa mama ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n David in atangvalte thu apie a, tuachi’n amauh athat ua, akhut u’leh a keng uh atan pieh ua, Hebron luikhuh gei ah akhai ua, hinanleh Ishbosheth lutang ava la ua, Hebron a Abner han ah avuita uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel nam zousie Hebron a David kungah ahing pei ua, “Ngai in, na gu leh nasa ka hi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuamabangin, Tumasanga Saul ka tung ua leeng ahi lai in, nangma Israel gam ah puidoh leh puilut tu na hi zel a; tualeh Mangpa’n na kungah, ka mi Israelte na vaa dinga, tualeh Israelte tungah vai nahawm ding hi achi hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel upate zousie Hebron a leengpa kungah ahing pei ua, tualeh Leengpa David in Hebron ah Mangpa masangah amautoh thuhun abawla tuachi’n Israelte tunga leengpa dingin David sathau anu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />David in vai ahawm chiil lai in kum sawmthum a upa ahi a, kum sawmli sung vai ahawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hebron ah Judate tungah kum sagi leh ha guh vai ahawm a, tualeh Jerusalem ah Israelte leh Judate zousie tungah kum sawm thum leh kum thum vai ahawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh, leengpa leh amite khu agam a teng Jebus mite dou dingin Jerusalem ah a pei ua; tualeh khuna teng miten David kungah, “Tam mun ah na hinglut thei sih ding, mitto leh kengbaiten a hing nang ding uhi,” achi ua. “David hinglut thei sih va” chi’n angaisut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahivang in David in Zion kulpi alata a, tua khu David khopi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh David in khumi niin “Jebus mite douding poumate tuilawng kiphumna langah peitou u’henlen, David muda kengbai leh mittote that u’heh” achi hi. Tuaziehin “Amauten kengbai leh mitto leeng innsungah alut thei sih ding” achi zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n David kul sungah a um a, tualeh David khopi achita hi. Tuachi’n David in Millo akipat in khopi kimkot in asung lam ah kulpi abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n David ahing thupi deu deu a, galkapte Mangpa Pasian akungah a um zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Tai-ar leengpa Hiram in David kungah mi asawl a, Sidar singte ahah a, khut siemte leh suongkhen siemte zong asawl a, tuachi’n David inn a lampieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh David in Mangpa’n ama Israelte leengpa a pang dingin asudet a, tualeh ami Israelte ziehin a leenggam zong apahtawi ahi chi atheita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh David in Hebron akipat ahing pawt nuain Jerusalem ah zi leh meite aneibe nalai a, tuachi’n David in tapate leh tanute anei nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh tamte khu Jerusalem a piengte min ahi; Shammua, Shobab, Nathan, Solomon.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ibhar, Elishua, Nepheg, Japhia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh Elishama, Eliada, tualeh Eliphalet ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Philistin miten David khu Israel mite leengpa dingin sathau anu uh chi azah tahun, Philistin mite zousie David sui dingin akuontou ua, tualeh David in tua thu azah tahin kulpi ah apei suh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh Philistin mite zong ahing pei ua, Rephaim phaijang ah akiguol ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh David in Mangpa adonga, “Philistin mite dou dingin ka kuon diei? amauh ka khutah na hing pe diei?” achi hi. Tualeh Mangpa’n David kungah “Kuontouin, Philistin mite na khut ah ka hing pe ngeingei ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n David Baal-Perazim ah ahing pei a, khunah David in amauh akidoupi a, tualeh “Mangpa’n ka galte tuikiching hakhiet bang maiin ka masang ah ahing delzah piehta hi,” achi hi. Tuaziehin khummun min dingin Baal Perazim achita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua mun ah amilimte uh anuasie ua, tualeh David leh amiten tuate khu apomangta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh Philistin mite ahing kuontou kia ua, tuachi’n Rephaim phaijang ah akiguoldim kiata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh David in Mangpa adonga, “Aman peitou sin hinanleh anualang uah imkhum inlen, kawlsathau sing langa pat in va dou in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahi ding a, kawlsathau sing dawn a mi pei ging na zah chiengin kintahin del pai in Philistin mite dou dingin na masangah Mangpa apeita china ahi ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh David in Mangpa’n thu apieh bangin abawla, tualeh Philistin mite Geba apat in Gezer tandongin ale nawdohta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David in Israel mite lah a teltuom ngentang tulsawm thum akaikhawm kia a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh David akipandoh a, Juda gam a Baale khuo akipat in Cherubim te kikaal a um Galkapte Mangpa min apuohsah uh, Pasian bawm latou dingin akunga mipi um zousiete toh akuonta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n Pasian bawm khu muol tunga Abinadab inn apat in aladoh ua, bawngleng tha khat tung ah aguong ua, Abinadab tapate Uzzah leh Ahio in bawngleng tha khu aveng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Muol tunga Abinadab inn akipat in Pasian bawm ala khie ua, Ahio khu Pasian bawm masangah apei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n David leh Israel mipi zousie in Mangpa masangah silging thei chi tuom tuom, kaigingte chingtangte, khuong leh jamte, pengkul bineite leh sum-eng khutbehte atum ua atheitawp un aguolnuom uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh Nakon phuol ahing phahtah un, Uzzah in Pasian bawm azamphei a atudet a, bawngtal tegel a kipal khah zieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n Uzzah tungah Mangpa alungthah phuta asilbawl khel ziehin Pasian in tua mun ah asuliata a, Pasian bawm kungah ashita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa Uzzah tunga alungthah ziehin David alungkim ta sih a, khum mun khu Perez-Uzzah tuni tan in akichita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh khum niin David in Mangpa agiing ta mama a, tualeh “Bangchi’n Pasian bawm ka kungah ka tut theita diei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n David in Pasian bawm khu David khopi ah ama kungah atawllut nuomta sih a, hinanleh David in Gitmi Obed-Edom inn ah atutta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa bawm khu Gitmi Obed-Edom inn ah ha thum a umdenta hi. Tualeh Obed-Edom leh a innkuonte Mangpa’n aguolzawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh Pasian bawm ziehin “Mangpa’n Obed-Edom innkuonte leh anei alam zousie aguolzawl hi chi’n” David ahil ua. Tuachi’n David akuon a Pasian bawm khu Obed-edom inn akipat in David khopi ah kipahtahin alata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahi a, Mangpa bawm zawngten kal guh asuon tah un bawngtal leh belam thau in akithoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n David Mangpa mai ah theitawpin alaam a, tualeh David khu puon malngat siempu puon in akivon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n David leh Israel mi zousie in kikou zoi zoi leh pengkul mut ging toh Pasian bawm ahing puo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa bawm khu David khopi ahing tunin, Saul tanu Mikal in kotta apat in ana en a, tualeh Mangpa mai a, David laam a kidieng amu in, alungsim guh in asimmaw mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa bawm khu alalut ua, tualeh akoina dinga David in abawl mun puon inn sunga maitam ah akoita uhi. Tuachi’n David in halmang sillatte leh lemna sillatte Mangpa mai ah alaan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh David in halmang sillatte leh lemna sillatte alat zou tahin mipite khu galkapte Mangpa min in aguolzawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n David in mipite zousie Israel mipumpite, numei leh pasalte lah ah michin in atanchiet ding un, tanghou beu khat, saba khat leh grep kiphougaw bawm khat chiet ahawm a. Tuachi’n mi zousie amauh inn lam chiet ah apeita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n David zong ama innkuonpite guolzawl dingin anua pei kiata hi. Tualeh Saul tanu Mikal ama dawn dingin ava pawt a, akungah “Tuni’n Israelte leengpa thupi hina mai e, miginalou leh zumdan theilou guohtanga um bang mai in, tuni’n asuoh numeite masangah guohtangin zum theiloute bangin a um hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n David in Mikal kungah, “Na pa leh a innkuonte zousie sanga kei hing teldoh Mangpa mite; Israelte tunga leeng dinga hing guotpa Mangpa Ama ahi. Tuazieh a Mangpa masanga ka lam ding mawng ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tam sangin zong ka zumpi huoi zaw nalai ding, keima zong ka kisit nalai ding hi, hinanleh tua suoh numei na gente lah ah pahtawi in ka um ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuaziehin Saul tanu Mikal in ashi tandongin ta anei sih hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahi a, leengpa a inn ah atenga, akim avel a agalte lah akipat Mangpa’n galmuong a atawldamsah tah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lengpa’n guolnei Nathan kungah, “Tuin kei Sidar sing inn ah ka tenga, hinanleh Pasian bawm pen puon inn ah a um hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh Nathan in leengpa kungah, “Na lungsim a um bang tahin va bawl in, Mangpa na kungah aum hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanleh khum zan mama in, hichi ahia, Mangpa thu Nathan kungah ahing tunga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pei inlen ka suoh David va hil in, Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi. Ka tenna ding inn nangman nahing lam pieh ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel tate Izipt gam akipat ka puidoh a kipat in tuni tandongin inn ah ka um sih a, puon inn leh biehbuh ah ka um zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel tate zousie lah a ka peina tengah zong ka mi Israelte vah dinga thu ka pieh vaihawm mite kungah, bangdinga sidar singa inn hing lam piehlou nahi uoi chi’n ka genta amah?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaziehin ka suohpa David kungah, Galkapte Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi, Belamte tatna mun a belamte na zui kawina a kipat, ka mi Israelte tunga vaihawm dingin ka hing ladoh a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh na peina pou ah na kungah ka um zel a, na masangah na melmate zousie ka sumang zel a, leitunga mithupi tahte min bang min thupitah nei in ka hing bawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuathamlouin ka mi Israelte dingin mun khat ka guot dinga, amauh mun mama a aum ua, akisuon nawnlou na dingun, ka phutdet dinga, tumasanglai bangin gitlouna taten asugenthei nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh ka mi Israelte tunga vaihawm mite ka guot laibang ahinawn sih ding hi. Tualeh na melmate zousie lah akipat in galmuongin ka hing khawldam sahta ding hi; Tualouin zong Mangpa’n innkuon ahing siem pieh ding thu zong ahing hil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh na nite a hing bei a, napu leh pate kunga na lup hun chiengin, na nua a nahah nasuonte ka tungding dinga, tualeh aleenggam ka sudet ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aman ka min a dingin inn khat alam dinga, tualeh a leenggam mangtoupha kumtawn a dingin ka sudet ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kei apa ka hi dinga, ama ka tapa ahi dinga, sil abawlkhiel leh mihing chiengin ka taihil dinga, mihing tate vuohna in ka thunun ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanleh na masanga ka lahmangpa Saul akipat a, kalahmang bang zen in nangma akipat ka hepina ka lamang sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh na innkuon leh na leenggam na masang ah kumtawna suhdet ahi dinga, na mangtoupha zong kumtawn a suhdet ahi ding,” achi hi, chiin gen in, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tam thu zousie bangbang leh kilahnate bangbangin, Nathan in David kungah agenta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa David alut a, Mangpa mai ah atou a, akungah, Mangpa Pasian aw, “Kei koi ka hia? Tualeh ka innkuonte zong bang ahi ua, hichi tan chieng chieng na hing pui?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mangpa Pasian aw, tamte Nangma mitmu ah bangma tham ahi sih hi, hinanleh na suoh innkuonte umdan ding thu zong kum tampi sunga dingin na genzouta hi. Mangpa Pasian aw, tam khu mihingte kunga na bawl dan ngaina ahina a mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />David in na kunga bang ahiei agen nawn tuon ding? Aziehpen Mangpa Pasian in na suohpa na thei chien hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na suohpa thei dingin, na thu zieh leh nangma lungtang bang zelin, tam sil thupitah zousiete na bawl zouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaziehin Aw Mangpa Pasian, nangvang na thupi ahi. Ka bil ua ka zah zousie uh dungzui mabangun, nangma bang mawngmawng aum sih a, nang loungal Pasian dang a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Izipt gam a kipat leh namchin leh apasiente ulah a kipat a, Nangma a dinga nateldoh na mite masanga nangma adinga sil thupitah leh na gam a dinga sil chizat huoitah bawl ding leh ama min thupitah siem dinga, Pasian in ama mite hi dinga ateldoh na mi Israelte bang mawngmawng a um sih a, Nang loungal pasien dang mawngmawng aum sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na mi Israelte kumtawn a namite ahitheina dingun Nangma adinga na suhdettah ziehin, tualeh Nang Mangpa khu a Pasian uh na hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh tuin Mangpa Pasian aw, na suohpa tungtang leh a innkuonte tungtang thu nana gente kumtawn a dingin sudet inlen, tualeh Na gensa bangin bawl in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh galkapte Mangpa khu Israelte Pasian ahi chi’n Na min kumtawn in tawisangin umta hen, tualeh Na suohpa David innkuonte na masangah suhdet in umta heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Aw galkapte Mangpa Israelte Pasian, Na suohpa kungah innkuon kang phupieh ding chi’n Na phuongta ngal a, tuaziehin Na suohin tam thumna Na kungah ka tun ngam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Aw Mangpa Pasian tuin Nang Pasian nahi a, Na thu zong thutah ahia, tualeh tam hoina khu Na suoh kungah Na chiemta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuin Na suoh innkuonte kumtawna Na masanga aum ngitnget theina dingun guolzawl in, Aw Mangpa Pasian Nangma’n nana gen ta a, tualeh na guolzawlna a na suoh innkuonte kumtawn a guolzawlin umta u’hen” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Tambang nuain hichi ahing hia, David in Philistin mite adoua, azou a, tuachi’n David in Philistin mite thuneina bulpi Metheg Ammah a lahpiehta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n Moab mite adou a, azou kia a, tuol ah alumsah a, tena khau in ate a, guol ni khu suhlia dingin ate a, guol khat pen atawn a hingkhawi dingin ate hi. Tuachi’n Moab mite khu David suohin aumta ua, sie apie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />David in Euphrates lui donga gam la dinga akuon malam in Zobah leengpa Rehob tapa Hadadezer adou a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />David in sakolleng tul khat leh sakol tungtuong galkap zasagi tualeh keng apei galkap tul sawmni aman a, tualeh sakollengkai zousie azahui uh asattan pieh a, sakolleng kai ding za khat akhawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Damaska a Siria mite Zobah leengpa Hadadezer panpi dinga hing kuon David in Siria mi tul sawmni leh tul ni athat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n David in Siria gam a Damaska ah galkapte akoi a, tualeh Siria mite David suoh in a umta ua, sie alieu uhi. Mangpa’n David khu apei nalam lam ah gal azousah zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh David in Hadadezer galkap liente sana lumte alah pieh a, Jerusalem ah apawta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hadadezer khopite Betah leh Berothai apat in David in sum-eng tampi ala hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh Hamath leengpa Toi in David in Hadadezer adou a azouta chi ana za a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n Hadadezer adou a azaw zieh a, chibai va buh ding leh guolzawl dingin Toi in atapa Joram David kungah asawl a, Hadadezer in Toi ana kidou pi zieh ahi, Tualeh Joram in a Dangka belte uh sana belte ahing tawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuate khu gamdang ava zaw zousie akipata alah Dangka leh sanate zousie toh David in Mangpa kungah alan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuate khu Siriate, akipat, Moabte akipat, Ammon mite akipat, Philistin mite akipat, Amalek mite akipat, Zobah leengpa Rehob tapa Hadadezer apat a gallah silte bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh chi phaiguom a Siria mite tul sawm leh tulgiet va that zou ahing kinuale kia lam in David ana minthangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh aman Edom gam pumpi ah zong galkap akoi a, tuachi’n Edom mite zousie David mite ahing hita uhi. Tualeh apeina phot ah Mangpa’n David gal a zousah zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n David in Israelte zousie tungah vai ahawm a, tualeh David in amite zousie tungah kituptah leh Dihtat tahin vai ahawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Zeruiah tapa Joab khu galkap lamkai ahia, tualeh Ahilud tapa Jehoshaphat khu tanchin gielpa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh Ahitub tapa Zadok leh Abiathar tapa Ahimelek khu siempute ahi ua, tualeh Seraiah khu laigielpa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh Jehoiada tapa Benaiah khu Kereth mite leh Palethmite lamkai ahi a, tualeh David tapate khu vaihawm bulpite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh tuin David in “Jonathan zieh a hepina ka suhlat theina dingin, Saul innkuonte lah a mi adam nalai a um de aw?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Saul innkuonte suoh khat amin Ziba a um a, David kunga haw dingin ahan ua, tualeh leengpa’n akungah “Ziba na hiei?” achia, tualeh aman Hi e, “Kei na suohpa ka hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa’n akungah, “Saul innkuonte lah a mi khat beh um nawnlou ahi uoi mah? Pasian hepina atunga ka suhlat theina dingin,” achi hi. Tualeh Zibain leengpa kungah, “Jonathan in tapa khat anei nalai a, akeng zong abai hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa’n akungah, “Ama hei ah a um ei?” achi a, Ziba in akungah, “Ngai in, Lodebar a Ammiel tapa Makir inn ah aum hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa David in mi asawl a, Lodebar a Ammiel tapa Makir inn akipat in ava puisah ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh Saul tapa Jonathan tapa Mephibosheth David kunga ahing tun tahin amai a tuolsuin abohkhup a, chibai abuuh hi. Tualeh David in “Mephibosheth” achia, tualeh aman “Enin, na suohpa tanah ka um hi” chi’n adawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n David in akungah, “Zau sin, na pa Jonathan ziehin ka hing hepi ngei ngei dinga, napu Saul gam zousie ka hing tangsah kia dinga, tualeh ka dawkan ah ann na ne ngitnget ta ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n kun suhin chibai abuh a, “Kei ui pul bang bep na suoh bang ka hia, nang hichi ngaisah talawm ahiei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa’n Saul suohpa Ziba ahan a, akungah, “Na pu tapa kungah, Saul leh a innkuonte neilelam zousie a un in ka peta hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaziehin nangman na tapate leh na suohte toh ama a dingin lou nahaw pieh dinga, tuachia na pu tapa in neh ding anei theina dingin. Hinanleh na pu tapa Mephibosheth in vang ka dawkan ah ann ane ngitnget tading hi,” achi hi. Ziba in tapa sawm leh nga leh suoh sawmni anei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ziba in leengpa kungah, “Ka pu Lengpa’n asuohpa kunga thu apieh bang zel in na suohin ka bawl ding hi,” achi hi. Lengpan Mephibosheth in vang ka dawkan ah leengpa tapa khat bangbang in annkuong a im ding hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh Mephibosheth in tapa tangval khat anei a, amin Mika ahi. Tualeh Ziba inn a um zousie Mephibosheth suohte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mephibosheth khu Jerusalem ah a umta hi. Tuachi’n leengpa dawkan ah ann ane ngitnget ta a, tualeh akengte gel alang ni in abai hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh tamte nua in hichi ahing hi a, Ammon mite leengpa ashi a, tualeh atapa Hanun in ama mun ah vai ahawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n David in “Apa’n ahing hepi bangin ken zong Nahash tapa Hanun tungah hepina ka sulang sam ding” achi hi. Tuachi’n apa tungtang thu a hamuon dingin David in asuohte asawl a. Tuachi’n David suohte Ammon mite gam ava tung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hinanleh Ammon mite lamkaiten, apu uh Hanun kungah, David in “Na pa azatat zieh a, na kunga hamuon mi ahing sawl hi dingin na gingta amah? David in amite, khopite enkhe ding leh suhsiet tum a enchien dinga ahing sawl hizaw lou ding amah?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaziehin Hanun in David mi sawlte aman a akhamul uh kimkhat chiet aheu pieh a, tualeh apuonsilte uh alaikim tah ah atawbou uh pha bep in, atan pieh a, anua sawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />David ahil tahun aman ava dawn dingin mi asawl a, azum mama ziehun, leengpa’n na khamul uh ahing sau kia masangsie “Jerikou ah, umtadi unlen, tuazou chieng in hing peikia un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ammon miten David melma in abawl khata uh chi akithei bep un, Ammon miten, Beth-Rehob a Siriate leh Zoba a Siriate galkap tul sawmni leh leengpa Maakah akipat mi tul khat tualeh Is-Tob akipat mi tul sawm leh ni athuhah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />David in tua thu azah tahin Joab leh galkap hangsan zousie asawl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ammon mite zong ahing kuon khie ua, khopi lutna kotpi lam ah pan mun abawl ua, tualeh Zoba leh Rehob a Siria mite leh Ish-top mite tualeh Maakah mite pen atuom in daigei ah aum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Joab in, amailam leh anua lam ah ahing dou tum uhi chi athei tahin, Israelte lah a teltuomte lah a hoipente ateldoh a, Siria mite dou dingin panmun ana bawl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh adang teng a unaupa Abishai khut ah akoi a, Ammon mite dou dinga panmun alep theina dingun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh akungah, “Kei dou dinga Siriate ahat seng u’leh, nang hing panpi inlen, nang dinga Ammonte ahat seng u’leh, nangma panpi dingin ka hing kuon ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hangsan tahin um unlen, imite leh i Pasian khopi adingin na ikipasalsah ding uhi; Mangpa’n hoi asah bang bangin hing bawlta heh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joab leh akunga um mite Siriate toh kidou dingin, kidouna munlam azuonta uhi; tualeh amasangah ataithangta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh Ammon miten Siriate ataithangta uh chi atheitah un ama u’zong Abishai masangah ataikeh ua, khuo ah alutta uhi. Tualeh Joab in Ammon mite akiasana, Jerusalem ah apeita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh Siriaten Israelte masangah aguollelta uh chi akithei tah un, akikhawmta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n Hadadezer in mi asawl a, lui gal a um Siria mite ava pui ua, Hadadezer galkap lamkai Shobak in ma akai a, Helam ah ahing tung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tam thu David ahil tah un, aman Israel mite zousie akaikhawm a, Jordan lui akan ua, Helam ava tungta uhi. Tualeh Siria miten zong Israelte dou dingin panmun ana lem ua, akidoupita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n Siria mite Israelte masang ah ataizahta ua, tualeh David in Siriate sakolleng tungtuong mi za sagi leh sakol tungtuong mi tul sawmli athat a, tualeh agalkap lamkai uh Shobak zong athat a khum mun ah ashita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh Hadadezer nasem a um leengte zousie Israelte masangah aguollelta uh chi atheitah un, Israelte toh kilemna abawl ua, ana uh asemta uhi. Tuachi’n Siriaten Ammon mite a panpi ngam nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahi a, kumte hing kihei a, khallai, leengte gal dou dinga akuon zel hun lai un, David in Joab leh leengpa mite tualeh Israel galkap zousie toh asawl a, Ammon mite ava sim ua, asuse gawp ua, tualeh Rabbah ah a um ua, hinanleh David pen Jerusalem ah aum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n hichi ahia, nitah lam ninem in, alupna akipat in David athou a, leengpa inn tungah avah a, tualeh inntunga kipat in numei khat kisillai amu a, tua numei khu melhoi tah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n David in mi asawl a, “Tua numeinu tanchin akan chien sah a. Tualeh mi khat in Eliam tanu Bath-Sheba, Hitmi Uria zi hilou ahiei mah?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh David in mi asawl a, ava pui ua, tualeh akungah ahing tunga, ana luppita a, aniin neizou laitah ahi a, tuachi’n a inn lam ah anua pei kiata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n numei ahing gaita a; tualeh “Nau ka paita hi” chiin David athei sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n David in Joab kungah, “Hitmi Uria ka kungah hing sawl in,” achi hi. Tualeh Joab in David kungah Uria asawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh Uria akung atun tahin, David in Joab leh mipite bang a chi uoi? tualeh kidouna bang achi zel ei? chiin ana dong a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh David in Uria kungah, “Inn lam ah pei inlen na kengte va silin,” achi hi. Tuachi’n Uria leengpa inn akipat apawtkhie a, tualeh leengpa’n neh ding silpieh in adelzui sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hinanleh Uria khu leengpa inn kotphung ah asuohte lah ah alumta a, ainn lam ah apeita sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n “Uria a inn lam ah apei sih chi David ahiltah un,” David in Uria kungah, “Khuol haw hing tung hilou na hiei mah? Bang dinga na inn a peilou na hiei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh Uria in David kungah, “Pasian bawmte, Israelte leh Judate, puonbuhte ah aum ua; tualeh ka pu Joab leh ka pu suohte gamlah ah akikul ua, kei ka inn ah ne ding leh dawn dingin, tualeh ka zi toh lumkhawm dingin ka pei ding amah? Na hinna louin ka gen ahi, tamvang ka bawl vawt sih ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n, David in Uria kungah, “Tuni zong tanah um tadi inlen, zing chiengin hing peisah navang” achi a. Tuachi’n Uria khum ni leh azing ni Jerusalem ah aumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n David in ahan a, amasangah ane in adawn a, tualeh ate kham a, tuachi’n nitah lam in a inn lam a peilou in apu suohte lah a lum dingin apawtkheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n zingmawngin hichi ahi a, David in Joab lai ahah a, Uria aposah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua alai hah ah, “Kidouna huoisietna pen mun ah Uria amaphuin pangsah inlen, atha ua, ashi theina dingin, kikhin san un,” chi’n agiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n hichi ahi a, Joab in khopi abulu laitah in, agalte hatna mun a atheina pen mun ah Uria apangsah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n khopi mite apawtdoh ua Joab toh akidou ua, tua mun ah David mite bangza ahiei ashi ua, tualeh Uria zong ashi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joab in mi asawl a, kidouna tungtanga sil umdan zousie David ahil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh ami sawlpa thu apie a, akungah leengpa kunga, “Kidouna a sil umdante na gen zou chienga;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lengpa ahing lungthah phut a, Bangdinga khuo nava lu lai ua, khum bang lawm lawm a nava nai uh ahiei? kulpi banga kipat in ahing kap ding uh chi theilou nahi uoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jerubeth tapa Ahimelek that koi ahiei? Numei khat in bu gawtguoina suong khat in kulpi tunga kipat a khe suh a, Thebez mun ah ashi hilou ahiei mah? achi leh na suoh Hitmi Uria zong ashi hi chiin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n a mi sawlpa ava pei a, atun tun in David kungah Joab in asawlna zieh zousie ahilta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh ami sawlpan David kungah, “Mite’n ahing nawh gawp ua, mun awng tan in ahing dou ua, hinanleh kou zong khopi lutna kulkotkhah tan ka nua naw kia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thalkap miten kul banga kipat in na suohte ahing kap ua, tuachi’n leengpa suohte bang za ahiei ashi ua, tualeh na suoh Hitmi Uria zong ashi hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachi’n David in mi kisawl pa kungah, “Joab kungah tambangin na gen ding hi, tam sil tungin na lungsim sunuomlou sih heh, aziehpen namsau in koima akhentuom sih hi. Nasa zawsemin khopi dou unlen, susie un, chiin Joab hanthawn in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh Uria zi in apasal ashita chi azah tahin a suun a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Asuunna hun abei tahin, David in mi asawl a, a inn ah ava puisah a, tuachi’n azi ahing hita, tualeh tapa anei a; hinanleh David silbawl in Mangpa alungkim sah sih hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n David kungah Nathan asawl a, tualeh akungah ahing pei a, akungah, “Khuo khat ah mi ni aum a; khat pen mi hausa ahi a, tualeh khat pen mi genthei ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi hausapa’n belam hon tampi leh ganhon tampi anei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hinanleh mi gentheipan belam nou anu neunou khat alei a, akhawi a, anou neunou khat chiloungal bangma anei sih a; akunga atate toh khanglien ahia, aneh neh anehpi a, adawn dawn a dawnpi a, tualeh a angsung ah aluppi a; ama a dingin atanu bang mai ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh mi hausapa inn ah khuolzin mi khat ava tunga, tualeh akunga va tungpa gaw dingin ama belam leh ganhonte phallouin migentheipa belamnou alahpieh a; a inn a tungpa agaw zawta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n David khum mipa tungah alungthah mama ta a, tualeh Nathan kungah “Mangpa hinna louin ka gen ahi, tuabang sil bawlpa khu ashi ngeingei ding ahi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh hichi bang sil abawl zieh leh hepina aneilou ziehin abelamnou ale li a adit ding ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n Nathan in David kungah, “Tua mipa khu nangma nahi! Israelte Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi; Israelte leengpa dingin sathau ka hing nu a, Saul khut akipat in, ka hing hundoh a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na pu inn leh na pu zite na angsung ah ka hing pie a, tualeh Israel leh Juda innkuonte ka hing pie hi. Tualeh tuate atawm seng nahlai lezong adang hing piehbe nalai ding hing a!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bangdinga Mangpa thupieh na simmaw a, amit mua sil gilou na bawl ahiei? Hitmi Uria na that a; azi na zi dingin na lahpieh a, ama Ammon mite namsau in na that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuin, namsau in na innsung akikhinsan vawt sih ding hi, nangman kei na hing simmaw a, Hitmi Uria zi na zi dinga na lahpieh ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mangpa’n tambangin achi hi, Ngai in nangma innsung ngei apat in na tungah sil hoilou ka piengsah dinga; na mitmu mama in na zite ka hing lahpieh dinga, na innvengte kungah ka pe dinga, tualeh aman suntanglai in na zite aluppi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nang aguh in na bawla, hinanleh Ken vang Israel mite zousie mitmu in suntang lai in ka bawl ding hi,” chiin achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n David in Nathan kungah, “Mangpa tungah kana bawlkhielta hi,” achi a; tualeh Nathan in David kungah, “Mangpa’n zong na khelna akoimangta hi; na shi sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bangtenghileh na sil bawl a Pasian gensietna lemtangtah, Mangpa melmate adinga na bawl ziehin nangma akipat a nau pieng ashi ngei ngei ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n Nathan in a inn lam ah apeisanta hi. Tualeh Uria zi in David ahinpieh tungah Mangpa’n akhut aha a, hatangpi in achi ana ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaziehin David in naupang a dingin Pasian kungah angen va ngua a tualeh ann a ngawl a, aluta tualeh zan tungtawnin tuol ah alum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n a innkuonte lah a upate adingdoh ua tuol a kipat a kaithou dingin akungah ading ua, hinanleh athou nuom sih a, akung uah ann zong ane ut sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n anisagi niin hichi ahia, naupang khu ashita hi. Tuachi’n asuohten naupang shi thu David ahil ngam ta sih ua, “Ngai in naupang adam laiin ithu gen angaikhe ut sih a, naupang ashita chi bangchin ihil ngam diei? bangchi ahiei in akisuna kha ding hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />David in asuohte kidaphou amu tahin, naupang ashi ahita chi atheita a. Tuaziehin David in asuohte kungah, “Naupang ashita amah?” achi a, tualeh amaun “A shita” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n David tuol a kipat athou a, akisil a, sathau akinu a, tualeh apuonsilte ahenga, Mangpa inn ah aluta, Pasian abie hi; tuachi’n a inn lam ah apei a, neh ding a kan a, tuachi’n amasang ah ann alui ua, aneta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n asuohten akungah, “Tambanga na silbawlte bangchidan ahiei? Naupang adamlai in ann na ngawl a, na kap a, hinanleh naupang ashi tahin na thou a, ann na ne pai valong mawh a,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman “Naupang adamlai in ann ngawl in ka kap ngut a, naupang adam theina dingin, Mangpa’n ahing hepi khamaw diei mah chi koi in athei ei? ka chia ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hinanleh tuin ashita a, bangdinga ann ka ngawl ding ahiei? ka nua hat thei kia ding amah? kei ama kungah ka pei dinga, hinanleh ama kei kungah ahing peikia thei sih ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n David in azi Bathsheba ahamuon a, tualeh akungah ava pei a, aluppi a, tuachi’n amanu’n tapa khat anei a, amin Solomon aphuo hi, tualeh Mangpa’n ama a it hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh aman guolnei Nathan avaihah a; tualeh amin dingin Mangpa kitap in Jedidiah aphuo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joab in Ammon mite khopi Rabbah ava sim a, tualeh leengpa tenna khopi alata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh Joab in David kungah mi asawl a, “Rabbah ka dou a, atuilahna mun dong uh ka lata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuin mipi um nalai teng khawm inlen khopi dou dingin zuon inlen va la in, tua ahisihleh keiman khopi kala dinga ka min apo kha ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuachi’n David in mipite zousie ahan khawm a, Rabbah ah akuon ua, asim ua, alata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tualeh aleengpa uh lallukhu alutunga um khu alah pieh a, tuakhu suongmantam akibawl sana talent khat buh ahi, tualeh David akhusah uhi. Tualeh khum khopi a gallah sum tampi ahing puo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tualeh khopi sunga mipite ahing puidoh a, sing atnate, lou hawna sia-zumte, sia heipite zangin nna asem sah a, Ammon mite khopi zousie tuabangin abawl hi. Tualeh David leh mipite zousie Jerusalem ah anua pei kiata uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh tamte nua in hichi ahi a, David tapa Absalom in sanggam numei melhoi mama khat anei a, amin Tamar ahi, tualeh David tapa Amnon in amanu adeigaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amnon khu a sanggamnu Tamar angai seng ziehin achimaw senga achina ta hi, amanu lah nungah siengthou ahi ngal a. Tualeh atunga sil bang ahiei bawl ding lah, Amnon dinga hasa tah ahi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hinanleh Amnon in lawm khat anei a, amin Jonadab ahia, David sanggampa Shimeah tapa ahi. Jonadab khu mi khelpil tah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh aman Amnon kungah, “Bangchidan a, nang leengpa tapa ani sim a na hichi gawn deu deu tah mai? na hing hil thei sih ding amah?” achi hi. Tualeh Amnon in akungah, “Ka sanggampa Absalom sanggam nu Tamar ka ngai senga ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh Jonadab in akungah, “Kichinasah inlen na lupna tungah lum khin khian inlen, na pa’n ahing et chiengin, akungah, hepitahin ka sanggamnu Tamar ka kungah hing pei henlen, tanghou neh ding hing pie henlen, tualeh ka mitmu mama ah neh ding hing bawlpieh heh, amanu khut tung pansan ka ne ding hi, chi’n ana genin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n Amnon a china kipangin lupna ah alumta a. Tuachi’n leengpa David ama en dinga ahing pei tahin, Amnon in leengpa kungah, “Hepitahin ka sanggamnu Tamar hing pei henlen, ama khut apata ka neh theina dingin, tanghou tuitah ka mitmu ah hing bawl pieh henlen ama khut ngei akipat ka ne ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n David in Tamar kungah, “Na sanggampa Amnon inn ah va haw inlen, aneh ding va bawl pieh in chiin,” a inn ah mi asawl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n Tamar asanggampa Amnon inn ah ava haw a, amapa ana lum a, tualeh tangbuong ala a, ameh a amitmu ah tanghou abawla, akangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh akanna khangbel ala khie a, amasang ah alui a, hinanleh ane nuom sih hi. Tualeh Amnon in “Mi zousie in hing pawtsan uheh” achia, tuachi’n mi zousien apawtsanta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n Amnon in Tamar kungah, “Na khut a pat ka neh theina dingin nehdingte ka lupna pindan sungah hing tawilut in” achi hi. Tualeh Tamar in atanghou bawlte ala a, pindan sunga asanggampa kungah atawilutta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Neh dingte akunga atawilut tahin, amanu ana pummat a, “Hing lum vawi, ka sanggam nu,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amanu’n adawnga “Hilou e, ka sanggampa, hing pawng bawlsin, Israelte lah ah tambang sil bawl ding ahi sih hi, tam minsiet huoi sil bawl vawt sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh ken ka minsietna hei ah ka phuol ta diei? tualeh nang zong Israelte lah a mimaw khat a sim na hing hi kha ding hi. Tuaziehin, tuin hepitahin leengpa houpi zaw in, nang kitenpi ahing phal khamaw sih ding hi;” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bangtenghileh athugen a ngaipieh sih a, ama sangin ahatzaw ngal a, apawng bawla tuachi’n aluppita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n Amnon in huot chitahin ahuo a, ana ngai lai a, angaina sangin ahuotna alien zaw ta hi, tuachi’n Amnon in akungah “Thou inlen, peimangin” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n amanu’n akungah, “Hichi ding ahi sih, hichi banga dihlou tah a nang deldoh khu ka tunga na tatsietna teng sangin ahoi sih zaw hi,” achi hi. Hinanleh anahsah tuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n aneh leh dawn bawl asuohpa a han a, “Tam numeinu ka kunga kipat inn pulam ah kaidoh inlen kot kil det in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amanu’n puonah zem tuom tuom a kizem asil a, tuabang puonahtuol khu leengpa nungah siengthouten asil zel mawng uh ahi. Tuachi’n asuohpa’n akaikhie a kot akhah det ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n Tamar in alu tungah vut akibuoh a, apuonah tuol zem tuom tuom a kizem asil khu abotkeh a, azangsip ah akhut toh akoi a, Aw ngaitah a kap kawm in apeita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh asanggampa Absalom in akungah, “Na sanggampa Amnon na kunga hing lut hi e? Hinanleh ka sanggamnu sip khin khian in, na sanggampa ahi; ngaisah dain,” achi hi. Tuachi’n Tamar asanggampa Absalom inn ah nguitahin, akikhum denta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hinanleh leengpa David in tam thute azah tahin alungthah mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh Absalom in asanggampa Amnon kungah asie hiin apha hitaleh bangma agen sih hi, asanggam nu Tamar apawng suol ziehin, Amnon amuda mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh kumni pumlum nua in hichi ahi a, Ephraim kunga Baal-Hazor ah Absalom in belam mul amet sah a, tualeh Absalom in leengpa tapate zousie achiel a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh Absalom leengpa kungah ava pei a, akung ah, “Ngai in na suohin belam mul ka met sah a, leengpa leh asuohte, na suohpa kunga hing haw dingin ka hing ngen hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hinanleh leengpa’n Absalom kungah, “Hilou e, ka tapa tutungin ka unpi un hing hawda kon va ung, nang hing subuoi giap va ung,” achia, tuachi’n aman achiel teitei a, hinanleh a ut tuom sih a, aguolzawl zawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuachi’n Absalom in akungah, “Ka sanggampa Amnon beeh ka kungah hing hawleh asih diei,” achi hi. Tualeh leengpa’n akungah, “Bangdingin ahing haw tuomse diei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hinanleh Absalom in Amnon leh leengpa tapa zousie beeh hawsah dingin angen teitei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tualeh Absalom in a suohte kungah, “Ngai un, Amnon in zu ahing kham a ahing lungnop hun chiemte unlen, tualeh Amnon that un kachi chiengin, that un, zau sih un, thu ka hing pie hilou ahiei mah, hangsan tah leh kipasalsah tahin um un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuachi’n Absalom suohten Amnon tungah Absalom in thu apieh bangin abawl ua, tuachi’n leengpa tapate zousie ading doh ua, asabiltung chiet uah atuong ua, ataimangta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahi a, lam lah a aum lai un, “Absalom in leengpa tapate zousie athat sienga khat zong akhawi sih” chiin David kungah thu ahing tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa adingdoh a, apuonsilte abotkeh a, lei ah alumta a, tualeh asuohte zousie in zong apuonte uh botkeh in akungah ading ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tualeh David sanggampa Shimeah tapa Jonadab in adawnga, “Ka puin leengpa tapa tangvalte zousie athat gam siengta hi chi, gingta sih heh, Amnon maimai ahi ashi. A sanggamnu Tamar apawngsuol ni akipat, Absalom in hichi banga bawl ding atup mawng ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuaziehin ka pu leengpa’n alungtangin leengpa tapate zousie ashi uh hi dingin alung gelsih heh, Amnon mai mai shi ahi bou hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuachi’n Absalom atai manga. Tualeh galveng tangvalpa’n dahdoh a, a et leh ngaiin, anua lam muolpang lampi ah mitampi ahing pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tualeh Jonadab in leengpa kungah, “En in, leengpa tapate ahing pei uhi, na suohin agen bangbang ana hina hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tuachi’n hichi ahia, athugen azaw leh zawlou kichinin, En in leengpa tapate ahing tung ua, tualeh hakain a kapta uhi. Lengpa leh asuohte zousie zong kaa chitahin akap uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Hinanleh Absalom ataimanga; Geshur leengpa Ammihud tapa Talmai kungah ava peita hi. Tualeh nichin in David in atapa asuun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tuachi’n Absalom ataimanga, Geshur gam ah apei a, tuanah kum thum ava um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tualeh Lengpa David khu Absalom kunga vahaw a ut mama a, Amnon tungtang thu ah a lung muong ta hi. Ama lah ashi taah zieh in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Zeruiah tapa Joab in leengpa lungsim Absalom tungah aum chi athei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Joab in Tekoa khuo ah mi asawl a, tuana kipat in numei piltah khat ava puisah a, akungah “Lusun bangin kibawl inlen, mi shi suunna puon sil inlen, sathau kinu sin, hinanleh hun sawtpi mishi suunna a na um numei bangin um in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa kungah va pei inlen,” tambangin a kungah va gen in, achi hi. Tambangin Joab in amanu thu amop hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh Tekoa khuo a numeinu’n, leengpa kunga thu agen ding kuonin amai tuol suin akhupboh a, chibai abuh a, akungah “Aw leengpa hing panpi in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa’n amanu kungah, “Na buoi na bang ahiei?” achi a. Tuachi’n amanu’n “Kei meithai ka hia, ka pasal ashita hi, chiin adawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh na suohnu’n tapa ni ka nei a, ani un lou ah akihau ua, aphel ding koima aum sih a khat pen in adang khat pen asatlia ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh ngaiin, tuin a innkuonpi tengin na suohnu adou huon ua, tualeh asanggampa thatpa khu hing pedoh in, asanggampa atha zieh a ama zong ka tha theina dingun, tualeh gouluo dingpa zong ka thatlia ngal ding uhi, achi ua. Tuabangin ka mei-am um nalai sunsun asumit ding ua, ka pasal min neilou leh leitunga hah le suon neilou a umsah ding ahita uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa’n numeinu kungah, “Na inn ah kipeita’n na tungtang thu ah thu ka pe nading hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh Tekoa numeinu’n leengpa kungah, “Lengpa Aw, kapu thulimlouna mawna keima leh ka pa innkuonpite tungah tung mai henlen, leengpa leh aleeng toupha in mawposih heh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa’n, “Koihinanleh na kunga thu hing gen pouma ka kungah hing zawpi inlen; tuachi’n ahing khawi nawn sih ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n amanu’n “Sisan suomite tunga phuba alah nawnlouna dingin leengpa’n Mangpa na Pasian thei ngitnget in, khuchilou in ka tapa asulum kha ding uh,” achi hi. Tuachi’n aman “Mangpa hinna lou in ka gen ahi, na tapa samzang khat zong tuol ah ake sih ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n numeinu’n akungah, “Kapu leengpa kungah thu kam khat ka hing gen ding,” achi a; tualeh aman “Siem ve,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh numeinu’n akung ah, ahileh Pasian mite doudal a “Bangdinga hichibanga na bawl sawm ahiei? tam athu gen a kipat in leengpa maw nanei mi khat bangin akilang hi, leengpa’n ami tai mangpa anua pui kia lou zieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aziehpen ashi chiet ding ihi ua, tualeh tui leitunga kibosa luoh kia theilou bang ihi uhi. Pasian in hinna alahmang ahi sih a, taimangpa khu ama lah a mi tuom ahilouna dingin alung geel zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuin kapu leengpa kunga tam thu gen dinga ka hing peina zong mite ka zau zieh ahi a, tualeh na suohnu’n leengpa kungah gen phot leng, leengpa’n asuohnu ngetna alawching sah khamaw diei mah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aziehpen leengpa’n kei leh ka tapa Pasian in goutan ahing pieh luolou dinga hing sumang ding mi khut akipat na suohnu hing hunkhe dingin leengpa’n ahing ngaikhe ding ka chia ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n na suohnu a dingin kapu leengpa thu khu hamuon huoitah ahi dinga; asie apha khen dingin kapu leengpa lah Pasian vansawlsieng bangmai ahi ziehin Mangpa na Pasian in ahing umpi zel ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa’n adawnga, numeinu kungah “Kang doh pouma ka kungah bangma im sin aw” achi hi. Tualeh numeinu’n “Kapu leengpa’n hepitahin hing gen heh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa’n “Tam thu ah Joab in pankhahna anei ei?” achi a. Tualeh numeinu’n “Kapu leengpa hinna louin ka gen ahi, kapu leengpa’n agensa koiman zietlam ahiei, veilam ahiei ah apel thei sih ding uhi: na suohpa Joab in ahing sawl a, tam thu zousie na suohnu kam ah amop sieng ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sil umdan sulamdang dingin, tam sil zousie na suoh Joab in abawl ahi, tualeh kapu pen leitunga sil um zousie thei dingin, Pasian vansawlsieng pilna bangmain apil hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa’n Joab kungah, “Ahoi hi, tam sil ka bawl ding hi; Tuaziehin kuon inlen, tangval Absalom va puikia in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joab amai a tuol suin abohkhupa, chibai abuh a, leengpa aguolzawla, Tualeh Joab in kapu leengpa aw, ka pu’n asuohpa ngetna alawchinsah ziehin “Tuni’n na suohin na mitmu ah deisahna ka tang hi chi na suohin ka theita,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joab adingdoh a, Geshur ah apei a, tualeh Absalom Jerusalem ah ava puita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa’n “Absalom ama inn ah pei henlen, ka mel mu sih heh,” achi a, tuachi’n Absalom ama inn lam ah apeita, leengpa mel amu sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Israelte zousie lah ah Absalom banga melhoi phat ding koima aum sih a, akeng akipat alu tandongin demna ding mawngmawng a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh asam aheu chiengin (kum kihei chin a aheu zel ahia) abuh zela, leengpa sil buh na a buh in Shekel zani agih ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh Absalom in tapa thum leh tanu ni anei a, atanu min khu Tamar ahia, numei melhoi tah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tualeh Absalom khu kum ni pumlum Jerusalem ah aum a, hinanleh leengpa mel amu sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuaziehin Absalom in leengpa kunga, ama hawsah dingin Joab ahan sah a, hinanleh ahaw nuom sih hi, ani veina in athuhah kia a, ahaw nuom tuomsih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuaziehin aman asuohte kungah, “En un, Joab lou khu kei lou kungtah ahia, barli bu achiing hi, pei unlen vahal pieh un,” achi hi. Tuachi’n Absalom suohten ava hal piehta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joab adingdoh a, Absalom kungah a inn ah ava haw a. “Bangdinga na suohten kalou ahal uh ahiei?” ava chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuachi’n Absalom in Joab adawnga, “Ngai in, bangdinga Geshur akipat a hing pei ka hiei? khunah um khin khian leeng kei dinga hoizaw ma ding hiven chia gen dinga, leengpa kunga ka hing sawl theina dinga hing haw in chia, ka hing thuhah ahia, tu’n zong leengpa mel hing musah in, ka thulimlouna um ahileh hing that suh mai heh,” chiin, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joab leengpa kungah ava haw a, ava hilta hi. Tualeh Absalom ahan sah a, leengpa kung ah ahing pei a, tualeh leengpa mai ah amai a tuolsu a bohkhup in chibai abuh a, tuachi’n leengpa’n Absalom ana tawp hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh tamte zou in, hichi ahia, Absalom in sakollengte leh sakolte tualeh mi sawmnga a masanga tai ding abawl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Absalom zingmawng matah in athou a, kul kotkhah lampi gei ah ana dinga, tualeh hichi ahi a, mi koipou thu buoi nei a, leengpa kunga kihehna thukhensah dinga ahing pei chiengun, Absalom in ana han a, “Koi khuo na hiei?” ana chi zel a. Tualeh amaun “Na suohpa Israel namte lah a khat ka hi,” achi zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n Absalom in akungah, “En in na thu khu ahoi in adih a, hinanleh na thu hing ngai tuopieh ding koima aguot sih hi,” ana chi zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Absalom in E! khai, “Kei vaihawm in pang leng aw, michin thubuoi nei pouma ka kungah ahing pei dinga, keiman dihtah a ana ngaituo pieh ding hi ing a,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahi a, mi koi ahiei in chibai buh dinga ava zot chiengin ana tuden a atawp zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuabangin Israel mi leengpa kunga, thutut dinga hing kuon pouma kungah ana bawl zel hi. Tuachi’n Absalom in Israel mite lungsim ana hip pieh zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh kum li nua in hichi ahi a, Absalom in leengpa kungah, “Hepitahin Mangpa kunga ka thu chiem sutangtung dingin Hebron khuo ah hing hawsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aziehpen na suohin Siria gam Geshur a ka um lai in, Jerusalem a na hing puikia pouma leh Mangpa nna ka sem ding, chiin thu kana chiem ta hi” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa’n akungah, “Hamuong tahin kuon in” achi hi. Tuachi’n adingdoh a Hebron ah ahawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinanleh Absalom in, “Pengkul gin na zah pouma chiengun, Hebron ah Absalom leeng ahita chiun” chiin, Israel nam zousiete kungah mi a dap sawl zouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh Absalom kungah, amichielte, mi za ni Jerusalem akipat in ava haw ua, lungsim hoitah puo a vahaw ahi ua, bangma athei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh Absalom in kithoinate alat laiin, Gilon mi Ahithophel, David vaihawmpi a khuo Giloh akipat athuhah a, athuphiel uh athupi mama a, Absalom lam pang mi lah apung deu deu ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh David kungah, “Israel mite lungsim Absalom langah a awn zouta” chiin thangkou khat ahing pei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n David in akungah “Jerusalem a mi um zousiete kungah, kisa un itai ding uh, Absalom akipat i suohta sih kha ding uh, kisa kin un, khuchilouin ahing lap man dinga, itung uah sil hoilou ahing tung dinga, namsau in khopi ahing dou ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa suohten, leengpa kungah, “Ngaiin na suohte leengpa ka pu un aguot pouma bawl dingin mansa ka hi uhi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa apawtdoh a, tualeh ainnkuonpite zousie’n azui ua. Tualeh leengpa’n ainn ngah dingin ameite numei sawm a nuasie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa apawtdoh a, mipite zousie’n anua azui ua, tualeh khopi pulam mun khat ah a khawl tadi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n asuohte zousie in amakhel ua, tualeh Kerethmite zousie, peleth mite zousie, leh Gath akipata ama zui Gitmi zaguhte leengpa makhel in amasang ah apei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa’n Gitmi Ittai kungah, “Bangchidan a, koutoh zawhkhawm ding na hiei mah? nua peikia inlen, leengpa kungah va um in, nang pen mikhuol leh gamdang mi, na gam a pat a nawdoh na hi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zani mama a hing tung pan na hia, tunia ka kung ua, asuh atou a hing zawpi dingin ka hing chi sam diei mah? kei pen ka pei theina lam lam a pei maiding ka hia, nangpen kia kia mai inlen na unaute zousie nua zawpi mai in, hepina leh thutah na kungah um heh” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh Ittai in leengpa adawnga, akungah “Mangpa hinna leh kapu hinna lou in kagen ahi, shina hiin hinna hitaleh kapu leengpa umna lam lam ah na suohpa ka um ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh David in Ittai kungah, “Peiin, masa in” achi hi. Tuachi’n Gitmi Ittai khu amite zousie leh ata neu noute zousie utoh apei zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh agam pumpi aw ngaitahin akapta ua, tualeh mipi zousie apei ua. Lengpa mama in gamdai lampi lang zuonin, kidron luita akaan a, tualeh mipi zousiein zong akaan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Khunah Zadok zong Levi mite zousie toh Pasian thuhun bawm zawngin akungah apei ua, Pasian bawm anga khie ua, tualeh mipite zousie in khopi ahen masang sie un, Abiathar apeitou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa’n Zadok kungah, “Pasian bawm khopi sungah zawnglut kia un, Mangpa mitmu a deisahna ka tanleh, ahing pui kia dinga, Pasian bawm leh aumna ahing mu sah kia na ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hinanleh nangma ah kipahna mawngmawng ka neisih achileh, tanah ka um a, Aman hoi asah bangbangin ka tungah bawl mai heh” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Lengpan siempu Zadok kungah “Mutheipa na hi sih amah? Lungmuong tahin khopi sungah nuakia kia in, nangma leh na tapa ni, na tapa Ahimaz leh Abiathar tapa Jonathan toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />En in, nou akipat a theisahna thu ka zah masang sie’n kei pen, gamdai a lui kanna ah kaana um ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuaziehin Zadok leh Abiathar in, Jerusalem lam ah Pasian bawm azawng kiata ua khunah a um denta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuachi’n David khu Olive muol peitouna ah apeitou a, apei kawm in akap zel a, akilukhu a, akeng guohin apei a. Tualeh ama toh zawhkhawm mi zousie zong akilukhu ua, apeitou ua, apei kawm un akap uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuachi’n koi ahiei khat in, “Absalom thu phielpite lah ah, Ahithophel. Zong apang hi” chiin David ahila, tuachi’n “Aw Mangpa Ahithophel lem guotna khu, motna suoh sah in, chi’n ka hing ngen hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahia, David in Pasian abiehna muolvum atun tahin, Ark mi Hushai apuonah botkeh niai nuai leh alutunga leivui kai niai nuai in ama kimupi dingin ahing pei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />David in akungah, “Ka kunga na hing pei leh keima dingin puohgih nahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hinanleh khopi ah kia kia zaw inlen, Absalom kungah, Aw leengpa na suohin ka pang ding hi, tu masang lai a napa suoh a ka napan bangin ka pang kia ding, chi lachin, Ahithophel lemguotna hing dal pieh nahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tualeh khunah siempute Zadok leh Abiathar toh zong na um khawm hilou amah? tuaziehin hichi ahi dinga, leengpa innsunga na zah pouma siempute Zadok leh Abiathar kungah na hil sawn zel ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ngai in, amaun atapate uh ni, Zadok tapa Ahimaz leh Abiathar tapa Jonathan a umpi uhi, na thuzah pouma uh theisah dingin amauh na hing sawl zel ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tuachi’n David lawmpa Hushai khopi ah alut a, tualeh Absalom zong Jerusalem ah alut hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David in muol vum ahen zep nua in Mephibosheth suohpa Ziba in ana dawn a, sabiltung van puo ni, avan sunga, tanghou beu zani, grep phougawsa bawh za khat, nipi theiga za khat leh uoin savun thawl khat aposah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa’n Ziba kungah, “Tamte bangchidan ahiei?” achi hi. Tuachi’n Ziba in “Tam sabiltung tegel leengpa innkuonpite tuonna ding ahia, tanghou leh nipi theite khu tangvalte neh ding ahia, tualeh uoin pen gamdai a dangta a basam poumate dawn ding ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa’n akungah, “Napu tapa hei ah a um ei?” achi a. Tualeh Ziba in leengpa kungah, “Ngai in Jerusalem ah aum hi, aman tuni’n Israel innkuonten ka pa gam hing pe ding ahi uh, achi uh, chi’n agen hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa’n Ziba kungah, “Ngai in Mephibosheth sil nei tengteng nangma a ahita,” achi hi. Tualeh Ziba in akungah, “Aw kapu leengpa, na mitmu a deisahna katan theina dingin, kingai ngiem tahin na mai ah ka kun hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa David Bahurim ahing tun tahin, ngai in, Saul innkuonte lah a mi, Gera tapa amin Shimei ahing pawtkhie a, hamsielaw kawm in ahing pei a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />David suongin asep a, tualeh leengpa David suohte zousie leh mipi zousie tualeh galkap hat hangsan zousie zong aziet leh vei ah aum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh Shimei in ahamsiet sungin, hichiin achi hi, “Pawtmangin, pawtmangin, nang sisan suo hatpa leh khansepa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ataanga leenga napan, Saul innkuonte phuba zousie, Mangpa’n na tungah ale heita a, tualeh agam khu Mangpa’n natapa Absalom khut ah apeta hi. Tuachi’n tuin ngaiin, sisan suohatmi na hi ziehin, nangma sietna sukha na hita hi” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n Zeruiah tapa Abishai in leengpa kungah, “Bangzieh a tam ui pul khat in kapu leengpa hamsiet luon ding ahiei, ka kuon dinga alu kava tan pieh aw” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa’n “Zeruiah tapate aw, nou hing theipi ding bang a hiei um? Mangpa’n akunga David samsie in achileh ahing samsiet ding mawng ahi. Bangding a hichi banga bawl na hiei, koi in achi thei diei?” achi hi. (Kaala. 3.38); Rom. 9.20
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh David in Abishai leh asuohte zousie kungah, “Ngai un keima khaal a pieng ka tapa ngel in tha ahing tup leh; Tam Benjamin mi in hing tum nama louding ahiei mah? don da un, aw sie suo mai heh, Mangpa’n asuosah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mangpa’n ka gentheina hing mu van in, tunia ahing samsietna, ahoilam in Mangpa’n hing thuhta hen,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachia David leh amite lampi a apeilai un, Shimei zong muolpang zul zul ah apei a, apei kawm in aw sie alawkhum zela, suongin asep zel a, tualeh leivui athe zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa leh akunga um mi zousie, gim tahin atung ua, tuanah akhawl tawldam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuabang hunlai tahin, Absalom leh Israel mipite zousie Jerusalem ah ahing tung ua, alah uah Ahithophel zong apang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahi a, David lawmpa Ark mi Hushai Absalom kunga atuntahin, Hushai in Absalom kungah “Leengpa damsawt hen, Leengpa damsawt hen,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n Absalom in Hushai kungah, “Tam khu na lawmpa na hepina ahiei? bang dinga na lawmpa kunga peilou na hiei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hushai in Absalom kungah, “Peilou e, koi hinanleh Mangpa leh tam mipite leh Israel mi zousie’n atel phot pouma a ka hi dinga, ama kungah ka um den ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh koi nna ahiei ka sep ding? atapa masang ah nna ka sem sih diei mah? na pa nna kana sep bangin nangma nna zong ka sem ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n Absalom in Ahithophel kungah, “Na lunggel inlen hing hil in, bang ahiei ibawl ding?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh Ahithophel in Absalom kungah, “Na pa mei innngah dinga akoite va luppi in tuachi’n Israel mi zousie in, na pa’n ahing muda hi chi aza ding ua, tuachi’n na kunga um zousie khut na suhat ding hi” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n Absalom adingin, inntung vum ah puon inn azah pieh ua, tualeh Israel mi zousie mitmu in suntang laiin Absalom in apa meite aluppi ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Khum hun lai in Ahithophel lemguotnate khu, miten Pasian kam suoh bangin angai ua; tuachimabangin Ahithophel in David leh Absalom alemguot pinate khu ngai ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuathamlouin, a Ahithophel in Absalom kungah “Tuin galkap tul sawm leh ni hing teldoh inlen, tuachi’n ka kipandoh dinga, tuzan mama in David kava nuadel ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Agim leh ahatlou laitahin kava nua phah ding a, kava zausah dinga, akunga mi zousie ataimang ding ua, tuachi’n leengpa maimai kava that mai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n mipi zousie na kungah ka hing pui kia dinga, na mi suipa shina khu mi zousie hing kinuale bang ahi ding a, tuachi’n mi zousie lungmuong tahin a um mai ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Athu genin Absalom leh Israel upate akipah sahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh Absalom in “Ark mi Hushai zong hing han un, ama thugen zong ingaikhe ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Absalom kunga Hushai ahing tun tahin, Absalom in akungah, “Ahithophel in tambangin a gen a, ama gen bang bangin ibawl diei le? ibawllou ding leh nang hing gen in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n Hushai in Absalom kungah, “Tutunga Ahithophel lemguot ahoi sih hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hushai in, “Na pa leh amite na thei a; mihat leh hangsan ngen ahi ua, gam lah a vompi anou kilahpieh bang mai ahi ua, tualeh na pa zong galdou siem mi ahia, mipite lah ah agieh sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ngai in leihawm sung ahiei, ahisihleh heisung mun ahiei khat ah akibu ahi ding, tualeh hichi ahi dinga, kidou chiilna ah mi pawl khat pua taleh aza pouma in Absalom nua zuite kithat gamta chia kigen ding ahibou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n mi hangsantah humpibahnei banga lungsim pawte zong alungke sieng ding uhi, aziehpen Israel mi zousie’n na pa galhangtah ahidan leh akunga mi umte mi hangsan tahtah ahidan uh athei sieng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaziehin keima lemgel dan in, Israel mi zousie Dan akipat Beer-Sheba tandongin, tuipi pieunel za ding phiel na kungah ki kaikhawm in, nangma tahsa ngel zong kidouna ah kuon inlen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n heisung mun hitaleh ikituoh tuohna ah, leitunga daitui kie bang mai in ikibawhuon ding ua, tuachi’n ama leh akunga mi um zousie khat zong ikhawi sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahisihleh khuo a ana lut tah leh zong, Israel mi zousie in khauhuol tawi in khum khuo ah iva lut ding ua suongnou khat zong nuselou in lui ah ikaikhe suh mai ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n Absalom leh Israel mi zousie in “Ark mi Hushai lemguot khu Ahithophel lemguot sangin ahoizaw,” achi uhi. Aziehpen Mangpa’n Absalom tunga sil hoilou atunsah theina ding a, Mangpa’n Ahithophel lemguotna hoitah dalna dinga ana guotzou ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n Hushai in siempute Zadok leh Abiathar kungah, “Ahithophel in Absalom leh Israel upate alemguotpi danleh, aman alemguotpi dan ahil sawnta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaziehin David kungah mi sawl pai inlen akungah, tuzanin gamdai lui kaanna ah gieh nawn sinlen akinthei pen in kaan zawin, khuchilou in leengpa leh akunga um zousie valzouin aumkha ding uh, chisah in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jonathan leh Ahimaaz khu En Rogel ah a um ua, suoh numei khat in amauh ava hil zel hi; tuachi’n amaun leengpa David ava hil sawn zel uhi. Khopi a alut uh koiman amulou na ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hinanleh naupang khat in ana mu a, Absalom ava hil a, tuachi’n ani un ataimang pai ua, Bahurim a mi khat inn ah atung ua, tuapa’n a inn huong sungah tui kul khat anei a, khunah alutta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n numei in tuikul kam khu a sitna in asinkhum a, tualeh atungah bu aphou a, tuakhu koiman athei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh Absalom suohte khu numeinu kunga ahing tuntah un, “Ahimaaz leh Jonathan hei ah a um uoi?” achi ua, tualeh numei in “Akung uah lui kaanta uh,” achi hi. Asui ua amu zoulou tah un Jerusalem ah anua kiata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahia, apei zou bep un tuikul akipat apawtdoh ua, David ava hil uhi. David kungah “Kisa inlen lui kaan mengin, Aziehpen Ahithophel in nangma kalin lem aguot hi,” achi ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n David leh akung a um, mi zousie akisa ua, Jordan akaan ua, phalvah in koima Jordan galkailou a um sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahithophel in ama lemguotna akizang sih chi athei tahin, asabiltung vante aguonga, akisa a, akho lang ua a inn ah apeita hi. Tualeh a innkuonte um dan ding abawlpieh dimdiem a, akikhailum a, ashita hi, tuachi’n apa han ah avuita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n David Mahanaim atunga, tualeh Absalom in akunga um Israel mi zousie toh Jordan lui akaan ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />tualeh Absalom in Joab thahengin Amasa khu galkap lamkai dingin akoi a. Amasa khu mi khat amin Ithra, Israel mi, Joab nu sanggampa Nahash tanu Abigail luppipa tapa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel mite leh Absalom in Gilead gam ah panmun abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing ahia, David Mahanaim atunin, Ammon mi Rabbah khuo a mi Nahash tapa Shobite, Lodebar khuo a mi Amiel tapa Makirte, Rogelim khuo a Gilead mi Barzillai ten;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />lupnate, maiphiet kuongte, leibelte, mang bute, barli bute, tangbuongte, be kan gawte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />khuoizute, bawng nawi datte, bawng nawi a pat a kibawl sathaute, belamte, David leh akunga um mipite neh dingin ahing tawi uhi. Gamdai ah “Mipite agilkiel ua, a gim ua, adang uh taa kha va achi zieh un.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n David in akunga um mipite asima, galkap tul tunga lamkaite, za tunga lamkaite aguonga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n David in galkapte asawl khie a, mun thum akhen mun khat Joab khut ah akoi a, mun thum a khena munkhat Zeruiah tapa Joab sanggampa Abishai khut ah akoi a, tualeh mun thum akhen a mun khat Gitmi Ittai khut ah akoi a, Lengpa ngel ngel in “Keima mama zong na kung uah galdou in ka hing kuon tei tei ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hinanleh mipiten adawng ua, “Nang vang na hing kuon lou ding a hi; aziehpen, koute na taizahta u’leng zong khawh asa sih ding ua; tualeh akim khat va shita u’leng zong khawh asa naituom sih ding uhi, hinanleh nang pen koute tul sawm toh kibanga manpha na hi, tuazieh in khopi a kipata, hing panpi dinga nana um ahoizaw hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa’n akung uah, “Hoina sah pen dan dan un ka um ding hi,” achi hi. Tuachi’n leengpa kulpi kotkha bul ah adinga, tualeh mipite aza aza in tualeh atul tul in akitawl zung zung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa’n Joab, Abishai leh Ittai kung ah, “Keima zal in tangval Absalom nem tahin hing bawl ta un” chiin thu apie hi. Tualeh Absalom tungtang thu a leengpa’n lamkaite zousie thu apieh khu mipiten aza chiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n mipite Israelte toh kidou dingin kidouna mun langah akuondohta ua, tualeh akidouna u’khu Ephraim gammang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel mite khu David mite masangah aguollelta ua, tuamun ah tua niin galkap tul sawmni tah athat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Akidouna un khum gam pumpi ahuop sieng a, tua niin namsau a shi sangin gammang in avallup atam zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n Absalom in David galkapte a tuoh phut a, tualeh Absalom khu Sabiltung tunga tuong ahi a, tualeh sabiltung khu gangpi sing bawhpha mama nuoi ah atai lut a, tuachi’n alutang gangpi singah a awhta a; vanle lei kikaal ah akikhai dengdong denta a, tualeh asabiltung lah ataimangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh koi ahiei khat in ava mu a, tuachi’n Joab ahil a, akungah, “Ngai in, Absalom gangpi singa kikhai ka mu hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joab in ama vahilpa kungah, “Ngaiin mu ngal chin a, Bang dinga that a tuol a kesah pai ngal lou na hiei? Tuabanga bawl hi lachin dangka shekel sawm leh kawnggah khat hing pe ding hima veng in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hinanleh tua mipa’n Joab kungah, “Dangka shekel tulkhat muding hinan leng zong leengpa tapa tungah khut kaha mawngmawng sih ding, achi a, aziehpen ka zah ngelngel un leengpa’n Nangma leh Abishai leh Ittai, thu ahing pie a, Absalom bangma lawlou dingin pilvangun achi ngal a, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khuchilouin vang keima hinna ngel sietna ding leptatna bawl ka hi dinga, leengpa mai ah lah bangma phuol thei ahi ngal sih a, nang lah na hing kisuhsiengsan ut pai ngal mai ding hi” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joab in “Hichibangin ka hing ngah sawt thei sih ding,” achi hi. Tualeh akhut ah teipi thum atawi a, gangpi singa ahinga na um nalai Absalom lungtang zawntah adawt pailet a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />tualeh galvan tawi tangval sawm in aim ua, athatta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joab in pengkul amut a, tuachi’n Israelte nuadel mipite akhawlta uhi, Joab in akham ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh Absalom luong ala ua, gammanga leihawm lienpi khat ah apailut ua, atung ah suong asep vum uhi. Tuachi’n Israel mi zousie amauh puon inn chiet ah ataizah ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Absalom in adam lai in, Lengpa phaijang ah suong khat ana phut a. Ka min manlouna dingin, “Tapa lah ka nei sih a,” achi hi. Tua suong phu khu ama min aposah a, tuni dongin Absalom thei zingna; akichi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n Zadok tapa Ahimaaz in, “Tu’n vatai vangin, Mangpa’n amelmate tunga phuba alah pieh dan tanchin leengpa kava hil aw,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joab in “Tuni’n vang tanchin va hil nai sin, nidang chiengin vahil nava teh. Hinanleh tuni’n leengpa tapa ashi ziehin tanchin va hil da tadi mai in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joab in Kush mi kungah, “Pei inlen leengpa kungah na silmu va hil vawi leh” achi hi. Tualeh Kush mi khu Joab mai ah akuna, tualeh ataita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n Zadok tapa Ahimaaz in Joab kung ah, “Abang abang hitaleh Kush mi va nua del vang” achi kia a. Joab in adawnga, akungah “Ka tapa aw, tanchin hilman lah mulou ding hichi’n a, bang dinga tai teitei ding na hiei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hinanleh aman “Asuoh nuom” suoh heh, “Tai mai vang,” achia, tualeh Joab in “Tai mai ve leh” achi hi. Tuachi’n Ahimaaz khu phaijang lampi langah atai a Kush mipa ama khel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh David khu kulpi kotkha nitegel kikaal ah atou a, tualeh galvengpa khu kulpi pulamtazaw banga pat in inntung lam ah akaltoua a dah kawi a a et leh, ngaiin mi khat amatangin ahing tai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachi’n galvengpa akikou a, leengpa ahilta hi. Tualeh leengpa’n “Amatang ahileh thu hing hil ding anei hiva achi a, ahing taihat deu deu a, ahing nai deudeu ta hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuachi’n galvengpan midang hing tai khat amu kia a, tuachi’n galvengpan kulpi kotkhah ngahpa ahan a, “En vawi midang khat amatang in ahing tai kia hi,” achi hi. Tualeh leengpa’n “Aman zong tanchin hing tut ding anei hiven” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh galvengpan “Ahing tai masa penpa khu Zadok tapa Ahimaz tai abang hi,” achi hi. Tualeh leengpa’n “Ama mi hoitah ahia, tanchin hoi hing tut ding ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tualeh Ahimaaz in ahan a, leengpa kungah “Bang kim ahoi hi,” achi hi. Tualeh leengpa mai ah boh khupin chibai abuh a, akungah, “Ka pu leengpa douna a atunga khut ha zousie hing pedohpa Mangpa na Pasian phat in umta hen,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Lengpa’n “Tangval Absalom adam nai mah?” achi a. Ahimaaz in adawnga, “Joab in leengpa suoh pa keima, a hing sawlkhieh lai in abuoi he hu uh ka mu a, hinanleh bang ahiei chi ka thei sih hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa’n, “Kihei inlen ka pam ah ding tadi in,” achi a, tuachi’n akiheia apam ah adingta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua zou tahin Kush mipa ahing tunga, leengpa kungah “Ka pu leengpa adingin tanchin hoi ka hing puoh hi, Nang hing doute zousie tungah tuniin Mangpa’n phuba ahing lahpieh tahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Lengpan Kush mipa kungah, “Tangval Absalom adam nai?” achi hi. Tualeh Kush mipan adawnga, “Kapu leengpa melmate leh na sietna ding sui mite zousie tua tangvalpa bangin um sieng uheh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa ada mama a, kulpi kotkhah tunga pindan ah ava peitou a, akapta hi. Tualeh apeitou kawmin, “Aw ka tapa Absalom nang sangin kei shi zaw mai leeng izaw, Aw Absalom ka tapa, ka tapa,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh “Ngai vawi, leengpa’n Absalom suun in akap kap mai hi,” chiin Joab ava hil ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n khum ni a aguolzawna ukhu mipi zousie a dingin mi shi suunna asuohzawta hi, mipite zousie’n “Leengpa a tapa shi ziehin ada mama mai hi,” chia kigen ana zata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mipite khu kidouna a guollel a taizah, azum zieh ua adap vah bangun, khum ni in aguhin khopi adap lut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lengpa’n amai ahum a, “Aw ka tapa Absalom, aw Absalom, ka tapa, ka tapa!” chi’n aw ngaitah suo in akap het hut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joab, leengpa inn sungah alut a, leengpa kungah, “Nangma’n tuni’n, Na hinna, na tapa leh na tanute hinna, na zite hinna leh na meite hinna humbit na mite zousie na zumsuota hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na melmate na it a, na lawmte na muda in na huo hi. Na galkap lamkai liente leh na suohte bangman na ngaisih chi tuni’n na sulangta hi. Aziehpen tuni’n Absalom pen dam henlen, kou adang zousie shi sieng u’leng na kipahna lamtah leh hoi nasah lamtah hileh kilawm in ka theita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuin, dingdoh inlen, hing pawtdoh inlen na suohte kungah lungmuon huoi tatah thu hing gen in. Mangpa min in ka kichiem ahi, na hing pawtdoh sihleh, tuzan in khat zong na kungah a um nawn sih dinga. Tuakhu na tangval akipat a tutan a sil hoilou na tunga tung zousie sangin ahoizaw sih ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa adingdoh a, kulpi kotpi ah atou a. Tualeh “Ngai un, leengpa kotpi phungah atou hi,” chiin mipi zousie ahilta ua; tuachi’n mipite zousie leengpa masangah ahing pei khawm uhi. Hinanleh Israelte pen ama u’puon inn chiet ah ataizahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Lengpan imelmate khut a kipat in ahing hunkhie a, Philistinte khut akipat ahing hundamta a, tualeh tuin Absalom ziehin gamsung ataisanta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh itung ua i leengpa ding ua sathau inupa Absalom lah kidouna ah ashita a; Bangdinga leengpa hat kia ding a kamkhat beh a zong vaihawm lou na hi uoi mah chiin mipite akisel valuoi uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa David in siempute Zadok leh Abiathar kungah, “Juda upate houpi unlen, bangdinga leengpa a inn a nuapui kia nadinga akiheh pen a pang na hi uoi mah? Israel mipiten leengpa pui kia ding thu agen u’lah leengpa’n ana zata ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka unaute na hi ua, ka gu leh ka tahsa na hi ua, bang dinga azekai pen a pang na hi uoi? chiin va gen un achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh Amasa kungah, kagu leh ka tahsa hilou na hiei mah? Joab taanga ka masanga galkap lamkai a, kang bawllou pouma leh Pasian in alawlaw hing law heh, tua sanga thupi zawin zong, chiin va gen un,” chi’n mi asawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuabangin Juda mite zousie lungsim mi khat lungsim bang mai in athuzawta hi, tuachi’n leengpa kungah, “Na mite zousie toh hing pei kiata un! chi dingin mi asawlta uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa anua pei kiata a, Jordan ava tunga. Tualeh Judate leengpa dawn ding leh Jordan lui a na pui galkai dingin Gilgal ah ava pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh Behurim a um Benjamin mi Gera tapa Shimei zong kintah a kisa in leengpa David dawn dingin Judate toh zawhkhawm dingin ahing pei suh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh akungah Benjamin mi tul khat leh Saul innkuonte nasem Ziba leh atapate sawm leh nga leh asuohte sawm azawpi a, tualeh leengpa masang ah Jordan agalkaita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa innkuonte pui kaina ding leh hoi asah bangbanga abawl dingin gunkuong khat agalkaipi uhi. Jordan lui agalkai tahin Gera tapa Shimei khu leengpa mai ah akhupboh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa kungah, “Ka pu in thulim louna nei in hing ngoh da thei tei tei henlen, tualeh ka pu leengpa’n Jerusalem na nuasie nia, na suohpa gamtat khelna zong melchi pieh sinlen, tualeh leengpa lungsim ah thamden sih heh achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aziehpen na suohpan ka khielta chi ka theita a, tuaziehin ngai in, Joseph innkuonte lah ah ka pu dawn dinga, tunia hing kuon masa pen zong kahi hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hinanleh Zeruiah tapa Abishai in adawnga, “Mangpa sathau nupa asamsiet zieh in Shimei thalia ahisih ding amah?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh David in “Nou Zeruiah tapate aw nouten na hing thei sah ding uh bang ahiei um? tuni’n kei hing doute na hisih uh amah?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa’n Shimei kungah, “Na shi sih ding hi,” achi hi. Lengpa akungah akichiemta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh Saul tupa Mephibosheth leengpa dawn dingin ahing kuon suh a, Lengpa apawtdoh ni akipat a galmuonga ahing kile kia ni tanin, akengte asil sih a, akhamul aheu sih a, tualeh apuonsilte asawp sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahi a, Jerusalem a leengpa dawn dinga a ahing pei in, leengpa’n akungah, “Mephibosheth bangdinga ka kunga hing pei lou na hiei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh aman adawnga, “Ka pu leengpa aw, ka suohpan ahing sol a ahi, na suohpan leengpa kunga pei dingin ka tuonna ding sabiltung ka siem ding ka chia, na suoh lah kengbai kahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh aman leengpa kapu kungah na suohpa aheh a, hinanleh kapu leengpa, Pasian vansawlsieng bang ahi a, tuaziehin hoi nasah bangbangin bawl mai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kapa innkuonpite zousie kapu leengpa masanga thalia sieng dinga kilawm ahi ngut ua, hinanleh na suohpa na dawkan a ann nete lah ah na pang sah nalai hi. Tuaziehin leengpa kunga sildang phut ngam nalai dingin ka kilawm na amah?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa’n “Na tungtang thu bang dia genkia zel na hiei mah? Nang leh Ziba gam kihawm un kana chita hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tualeh Mephibosheth in leengpa kungah, “Aman tang sieng mai heh, kapu leengpa lah ama tenna inn mama ah lungmuong tahin ahing tungta ngal a,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tualeh Gilead mi Barzillai Rogelim a kipat in ahing pei suh a; Lengpa Jordan a pui galkai dingin akungah Jordan akaan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Barzillai khu upa pi ahita a, kum sawm giet a upa ahi. Mahanaim a leengpa aumlai in neh leh taah ding ana pie hi, mi hausatah ahi ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa’n Barzillai kungah, “Ka kungah hing pei inlen, Jerusalem a ka kungah um in ka hing kem ding,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tualeh Berzilai in leengpa kungah, “Bangtan vei dam nalai ding ka hiei? Jerusalem a leengpa kunga ka pei tou na dingin?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuin kum sawm giet kahi ta a, asie leh apha ka khen theina ding amah? na suohin ka sil neh leh dawnte zong atui a al zong ka thei nawn amah? Pasal leh numeite la sah ging zong ka zah thei nawnlou pi, tuaziehin na suoh bangdingin ka pu leengpa dinga puohgih hi ding ka hiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Na suohin leengpa kunga Jordan galkai tei sam ding bou ka tup ahi. Bangdinga leengpa’n hichibang a hoiman ahing thuh se se ding ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Hepitahin na suohpa hing peisah kia maiin, ka hing ngen ahi, ka nu leh ka pa han umna keima khuo ngei ah ka kivui ding hi. Hinanleh na suohpa Kimham tanah a um hi, ama kapu Lengpa kungah galkai henlen, atungah hoi na sah bangbangin bawlin” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa’n adawnga, “Kimham ka kungah agalkai dinga, hoi nasah bang bangin atung ah ka bawl ding; tualeh na hing nget pouma ka hing bawl pieh ding,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tuachi’n mipi zousiein Jordan lui akaan ua, tualeh leengpa zong agal kai a, tuachi’n leengpa’n Barzillai atawpa, aguolzawl a, tuachi’n a umna lam ah akile kiata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa Gilgal ah agalkai a, Kimham zong akungah agalkai hi. Tualeh Judami zousie’n leengpa apui galkai ua, Israel mi kimkhat zong apang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tua laitah in, Israel mizousie leengpa kungah ahing pei ua, tualeh akungah, “Bangdinga, ka unau uh Juda miten nang ahing guhmang ua, tualeh leengpa leh ainnkuonte, tualeh David mite zousie zong Jordan gal a puikhawm sieng uh ahiei?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tuachi’n Juda mi tengtengin Israel mite a dawng ua, “Leengpa ka kinaipi uh ahizieh ahi; bangdinga tam thu zieh a lungthah nahi uoi? leengpa neisa ne kahi uoi mah? ahisihleh sil pieh bang ahiei ahing pekha amah?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tualeh Israel miten Juda mite adawng ua. “Lengpa ah tan sawm ka nei ua, David ah noute sangin sunglaitang zaw ka hi uhi, bang ding a hing simmaw na hi uoi? leengpa pui kia ding sawm masate kahi sih uh amah?” achi uhi. Tuachi’n Juda mite thugen khu Israel mite thugen sangin a gum zaw hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh khum mun ah, gamtat hoilou mi khat aum a, amin Sheba ahia, Bikri tapa Benjamin mi ahi. Tualeh aman pengkul amut a, “David ah tan bangma inei sih a, Jesse tapa ah zong gouluo ding inei tuom sih uhi. Israelte aw michin na puon inn chiet uah kipeita un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel mi zousie in David azui uh atawpsan ua, Bikri tapa Sheba azuita uhi, hinanleh Juda miten Jordan akipat Jerusalem tandongin a leengpa uh azui chinten uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n David khu Jerusalema a inn ah ahing tunga; tualeh leengpa’n ameite sawm inn ngah dinga akoite apui a, inn ah akoi a, aneh ding uh apie a, hinanleh aluppi sih hi, tuachi’n ashi tandong un, khum innah aum ua, meithai bangin a umta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa’n Amasa kungah, “Ni thum sung in Judamite hing khop khawm pieh inlen, tualeh nangma zong hing pei in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Amasa Judate hankhawm dingin akuon a, hinanleh ahun bihieh sung sang in ava taam sawt zawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n David in Abishai kungah, “Tuin Bikri tapa Sheba in Absalom sangin zong ipoi uh khoi zaw ding ahita; na pu mite zawpi inlen del un, khuchilouin, kulpi nei khopite ah alutman dinga ihasuo kha ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joab mite, Kerethmite, Pelethmite leh a mihat zousie in ama azuita ua, Jerusalem akipat in Bikri tapa Sheba del dingin akuonkheta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gibeon a suongpi umna ava tun un, Amasa in amaute ana dawn a, tualeh Joab in kidouna vonte asil a, tualeh atungah namsau apai toh kawnggah a kigah akawng ah akuo a, tualeh amai lam zuon a apei lai in aketa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh Joab in Amasa kungah, “Na damzel na maw, ka sanggampa?” achi hi. Tualeh Joab in Amasa tawp tum in azietlam khut in a khamul ah atu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinanleh Joab namsau tawilam Amasa in ana thei sih a, tuachi’n agilah adawt a, agilzamte tuol ah akaikhe suh niai nuai a, sut kia ngailouin khunah ashita hi. Tuachi’n Joab leh asanggampa Abishai in Bikri tapa Sheba adelta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualai tahin Joab mite lah a tangval khat Amasa kungah a dinga, “Koipou Joab deisah pouma leh David lam a pang pouma in Joab zui uheh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hinanleh Amasa khu lamlien lai ah ama sisan lah ah akisai sai hi, Tualeh khum mipa’n mi zousie ding depdup amu in Amasa luong khu lam lien a kipat ala khie a, gam lah ah akoi doh a, puon akhu a; akunga hing pei pouma ding zela amu zieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh lam lien akipat asuondoh nua un, mizousie Bikri tapa Sheba del dingin Joab azuita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh Sheba in Israel nam zousie umna mun Abel leh Beth-Maakah tan dongin ana tuon suoh a, tualeh Bermite gam zousie zong ana tuon suoh a, tualeh akikhawm khawm ua, Sheba azuita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joab leh anua zuiten, Beth-Makaah gam a Abel khuo ah Sheba a imta uhi; Khopi imna’n pal abawl ua, khopi kulpi toh kizopin leipal asep sang ua, kulpi pulam ah avum vengvong mai hi. Tualeh Joab kunga um mi zousie in, suhchip sawm in a leitangte akhuot uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n khopi sunga kipat numei pilvang khat ahing kikou khie a, “Ngai un, Ngai un, Joab kungah, na kunga thu ka gen theina dingin hing nai heh chi’n hing gen pieh un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahing pei nai bepin, numei in akungah “Joab na hiei?” achia, tualeh Joab in adawnga “Kei kahi,” achi hi. Tuachi’n amanu’n akungah, “Na suohnu thugen ngaikhe vawiin,” achi hi. Tualeh aman “Ka ngaikhie hi” chi’n adawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n amanu’n thu agenta a, “Nidanglai in pei inlen na thudoh adawnna Abel khopi ah va ngaikhie in, ana chi zel ua, tuabangin thu atawp sah zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Koute Israelte lah a kituoh na dei leh gin um ka hi ua, nang pen in Israelte khuo lah a, kho bulpi pen suhsiet tum in na sui hi, bangdinga Mangpa goutan na nawmval tup ahiei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Joab in adawnga, akungah, “Tuabang katum laizang sih hi, suh siet ahiei, nawmval ahiei ka tum mawngmawng sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Khuchibang lamsang ahisiha, Ephraim singtang gam a hing kipan Bikri tapa amin Sheba, leengpa tungah helna abawl a, David ngelngel dou in akhut alaam a, ama hing pedoh pou u’lachin khopi ka pawtsan mai ding hi,” achi hi. Tualeh numei in Joab kungah, “Na en in, alutang kulpi pulam ah ka hing paikhieh pieh ding uh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n numei in apilna thawin mipi zousie kungah ava pei a, tualeh Bikri tapa Sheba lutang atan ua, tualeh Joab kung langah apai kheta uhi. Tuachi’n Joab in pengkul amuta, a innlam chiet uh zuon in, khopi nuasie in apeita uhi. Tualeh Joab pen Jerusalem a leengpa kungah akinua le ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Joab khu Israelte zousie tunga lamkai ahia, Benaiah (Jehoiada tapa) khu Kerethmite leh Pelethmite lamkai ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh Adoram khu nasem a kiguoite lamkai in apanga, tualeh Alihud tapa Jehoshaphat khu tanchin giel in apang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh Sheva khu lai gielpa ahia, tualeh Zadok leh Abiathar khu siempute ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh Jair mi Ira zong David vaihawmpa lien pen ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh David damlai in kumthum kizom in kiel atunga, Tualeh David in Mangpa adonga, tualeh Mangpa’n adawnga, “Saul zieh leh a innkuonte sisan suo mite zieh ahi, Gibeonte atha zieh uh ahi,” achi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa’n Gibeonte ahan a, akung uah, (Gibeonte Israelte hah le suon ahi sih ua, Amormi um sunte ahi zaw uhi; tualeh Israel leh Juda hahlesuonte dinga, aphattuom ngai lai un, amauh tha tumin Saul in ana sui sui hi).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaziehin David in Gibeonte kungah, “Bang ahiei ka hing bawl pieh ding? Tualeh Mangpa goutan na guolzawl theina dingun, bangchibang kilepna ka bawl diei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh Gibeonten a kungah, “Saul leh a innkuonte tung thu ah, Sana leh dangka lam thu ahi sih a, Israelte lah ah kou a dingin mi thalia thei lah ahi sih hi” achi uhi. Tualeh aman, “Na chichi uh ka hing bawl pieh ding,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh amaun leengpa adawng ua, “Ahing sumangpa leh Israel gamsung mawngmawng a umsah lou dinga hing sumang dia kisapa;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Atapate sagite hing pekhie inlen, tualeh kouten Mangpa mitel Saul umna Gibeah khuo ah Mangpa masang ah ka khai ding uh” achi uhi. Tualeh leengpa’n amaute “Hing pe vang,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanleh leengpa’n Mangpa kunga David leh Saul tapa Jonathan kikaal a, ani ua kikaal a kichiemna ziehin Saul tapa Jonathan tapa Mephibosheth akhawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh leengpa’n Aiah tanu Rizpah tapa nite Saul a dinga ahin pieh Armoni leh Mephibosheth apui a, tualeh Meholath mi Barzillai tapa Adriel dinga ahinpieh, Saul tanu Mikal tapa ngate zong a pui khawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaute Gibeonte ape khie a, tualeh amun muol tungah Mangpa masangah akhai ua, tuachi’n asagi un mun khat ah ashi khawm uhi; tualeh bu lah hunlai barli bu lah kipat ani khat ni’n thalia in aumta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh Aiah tanu Rizpah in sai ip puon ala a, bu lah chiil akipat van guotui in aluongte uh abuoh khum masangsie a, aumna dingin suongpi tungah apha a, sun chiengin tungleng vate atung uah atusah sih a, zan chiengin gamsaten akhoisah sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh Saul meinu Aiah tanu Rizpah sil bawl khu David ava hil uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh David ava kuon a, Philistin miten Gilboa a Saul atha ua, Philistinten akhaina mun uh Beth Shan kholai akipata aguh a vala dap Jabesh Gilead mite akipat in Saul gu leh atapa Jonathan gute khu avala a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khuna Saul leh atapa Jonathan gute alatou a, tualeh akikhailiate gu ala khawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh Saul gu leh atapa Jonathan gute khu Benjamin gam a Zelah khuo ah apa Kish han ah avui ua, leengpa thupieh zousie a subuching uhi. Tuazouin khum gam tungah Pasian alungdamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuate zouin Philistinten Israelte adou kia ua; David amite toh akuon suh a, tualeh Philistinte toh akidou ua, David abasamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh Ishbi-benob miliente tapate lah a mikhat ahia, ateipi gihdan zong sum-eng buhnain shekel zathum agih ahi, aman namsau tha khat akuo a, David tha atum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hinanleh Zeruiah tapa Abishai in ava hundoh a, Philistin mipa asat a athatta hi. Tuachi’n David miten Israelte meivah na misah louna dingin, “Nang pen kalah uah galdou a, nang kuon nawnlou ding ahi,” chi’n akungah akichiem ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh tuate zouin hichi ahia, Gob khuo ah Philistin mite toh kidouna aum kia a. Tuami tungin Hushath mi Sibekai in, miliente tapate lah a mi khat Saph athat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh Gob khuo ah Philistin mite toh kidouna aum kia leuleu a, khunah Bethlehem mi Jaare-oregim tapa Elhanan in Gitmi Goliath athat kia a, ateipi khu siemgante chiem bang mai ahiem ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh Gath khuo ah kidouna aum kia a, khunah mi alet a lien khat, akhutphangte gel a a khutme guh tuah, akengphangte gel a akengme guh tuoh um, akigawma sawmni leh li nei aum a, ama zong miliente lah a pieng ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh aman Israelte asimmaw ziehin David sanggampa Shimei tapa Jonathan in athatta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tam mi lite khu Gath khuo a miliente hahlesuonte ahi uhi. Tualeh David leh amite khut ah ashi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa’n amelmate zousie khut akipat leh Saul khut akipat a Mangpa’n ahutkhiet zou in David in Mangpa Pasian kungah tam lathute a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh aman, “Mangpa khu ka suongpi, leh ka kulpi, leh ahing hundampa ahi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka Pasian khu ka kibutna suongpi ahia, Ka phaw leh ka hundamna kii ahia, Ka innsang leh ka kihumbitna ahi, Gumtat na lah a kipat Nangma’n, Nang hundam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pahtawi taah Pasian ka han ding a, Tuachi’n ka galte lah akipat in, hundam in ka um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Shina tuipi kihot in ahing kimkot a, Sietna tuipi in ahing tum mang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Shina khauhuolten ahing viel khuma, shina thangte ka kimvel ah akikam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Ka lungkham in Mangpa ka han a, Panpi dingin ka Pasian ka han zel hi. Aman abieh inn akipat ka aw aza a, Panpi ngai a ka kikouna angaikhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Tuachi’n lei akilinga, akinuh hi, Alungthah ziehin, Van kingah nate zong akinuh in a kiloh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Anahkuo hawm gel akipat meikhu apawt khie a, Akamsunga kipata mei pawt in; akatum zeng zung a, tuamin mei aamte a kuong sah pempom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aman vante zong a luoi kun a, ahing kunsuh hi; tualeh miel zong akeng nuoi ah a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cherub tung ah atuonga, alengta hi, tualeh huipi hatungah Ama mu in a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh miel khu ama tuomtu dingin abawl a, Tuipi miel kheng khungte leh vanlaizawl a meilum satahte akaikhawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama masanga vahphatnate ziehin, Suong meiholte akuong zei zoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mangpa’n van akipat in van a ging sah a, Tualeh Tungnung pen in a Aw a suoh sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Athaltangte a kapdoh a athethang hi, Tunphe aphesah a amaute asubuoi ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa housietna zieh a anahkuo hawm a hu a, asem ziehin tuipi lampi ahing kilanga, leitung kingapnate mudoh in aum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Aman tunglam akipat in ahing sawhsuh a, Ahing tudet a, tuipi tampi akipat ahing kaikhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahat mama ka galte lah akipat ahing hunkhie a, Kei hing mudate lah ah zong; kei ding in lah amauh a hat seng taluo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka tuohsiet ni in ahing dou ua, Hinanleh Mangpa khu ka kingahna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aman mun navah tahah ahing zawpi a; ka tunga akipah ziehin ahing na humbit hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Mangpa’n ka dihtatna bang zelin, Kipahman ahing pie a; Ka khutte asienthoudan dungzui in, nuomman ahing pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mangpa lampite ka zui a, ka Pasian akipat Gilou tahin ka piel mang ngai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A vaihawmna zousie ka masangah aum zel a; Athupiehte ka kileheisan ngai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amasangah zong gensiet bei ka hinalai a, Ka thulimlouna akipat ka kihem khe zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa’n ka dihtatna dungzui in, ahing na thuhta amitmu a, ka sien thouna dung zui in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Mi khotuo siemte kungah, khotuosiemin na sulang dinga, Mi hoikimte kungah, hoikim in naki sulang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mi siengthoute kungah siengthou in Na kisulang ding a, tualeh mi genhate kungah genha in Na kilang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Mi kingiemkhiehte na hundam dinga; mi kisatheite pen na ngiemkieh sah theina dingin, a tung ah na mit a tu zing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mangpa aw, kei dingin ka meivah na hia; tualeh Mangpa’n ka mielna ahing vahsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nang ziehin galte ka del a; Ka Pasian panpina ziehin kulpite ka tawm kaan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Pasian lampite ahoi bukim a, Mangpa thu atangtung zel hi; Ama muongte zousie a dingin Ama lum le phaw ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Mangpa chilou Pasian dang koi aum ei? I Pasian loungal suongpi koi a um ei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Pasian khu ka hatna leh silbawltheina ahi, Aman ka lampi ahoi bukimsah zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Aman ka kengte sazuhpi keng bangin abawl a, Ka munsangte ah ahing umsah zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ka khutte galkap dan azil sah a, Tuachi’n, Ka banten sum-eng thalpite aluoitan zou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Nangman na hundamna lum leh phaw na hing pie a, Na nunnemna in na hing siem lienta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ka nuoi a ka kalsuonte Na liensah a, Tuachi’n ka kengte a kitawl sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ka melmat a ka delpha a, amauh ka sumanga, Ka suhchimit masang sie’n ka kiheisan ngai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Athawzou nawn lou na dingun, Ka thatgam siengta a; ka masangah aguollel ua, ka keng nuoi ah apuata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Nangman galdou dingin hatna in, kakawng Na gah a, kei hing doute ka nuoi ah na thalpaita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Kei hing mudate ka suhmang theina dingin, Nangman ka galte nang nua ngatsan sahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Adah kawi kawi ua, hinanleh amauh hundam ding koima a um sih hi; Mangpa nangawn a en ua, hinanleh Aman adawng sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tuachi’n ken lei a leivui bangmai in ka satguoi dim dem a; kholai gawlzing buonnawi bang in ka tuon chil a, ka thezah ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />“Nang ka miten ahing helkhumna ua kipat in zong, Nang humbit a; namte lutang dingin na hing koi a, ka thei ngailou miten ka nna asem ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Gamdang mite ka kungah ahing kitulut ua; ka tanchin azah chiengun, ka thu azui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Gamdang mite alungke ding ua, akulpi ua kipat in chitun kawm in a hing pei suh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />“Mangpa ahing ngitnget a, ka suongpi phat in um hen, ka hundamna suongpi! ka Pasian khu tawisangin umta hen!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Phuba hing lahpiehpa leh, namchin ka nuoia hing thalpai piehpa khu Pasian ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Aman ka galte lah a kipat ahing hundam a, Nangman ahing doute tunglam ah Na hing khaang sanga, Mi gumtatte lah akipat in na hing hunkheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />“Tuaziehin Aw Mangpa namte lah ah, Na kungah kipah thu ka gen ding a, tualeh Na min phat in la kasa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Ama khu leengpa ding in hundamna innsang a hia, tualeh asathaunu David leh, ahahasuonte tungah khotuona kum tawn in a langsah ding hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tamte David thugen nukhia pente ahi. Jesse tapa David in tambangin agen hi; Sangtah adopsanga um, Jakob Pasian sathau nupa, Israel phatna la ngai tah phuohpain, tam bangin agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mangpa Hagau in keima mangin thu agen a, tualeh athu ka lei ah a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israelte Pasian in agen a, Israelte suongpi in ahing houpi a, mite tunga vaihawmpa leh, Pasian giing kawm a vaihawmpa khu; adih ngei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Zing mawng ni hing suoha, meilum kailou khovah bang ahi dinga, guo zuh zouchienga khuo hing sieng singseng, leitung hampa hing poudoh nou mitmet bang ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka innkuonte Pasian a kipan ahi sih uh amah? kumtawn thuhun ka kungah ahunga, bangkim kitup tah a sudet in, ka hundamna kim leh deidan kim, adawnsuong sah sih ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanleh mi helhatte pen lingle khau kinilmang bang ahi dinga, azieh pen khut a kithamtheilou ding ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanleh ama uh khoi ding mite pen, sia leh teipia akivon ding uh ahi, tualeh amaute khu amun mama ah mei a haltum in aum sieng ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tamte David mi hat leh hangsante min ahi. Takmon mi Joseb-Basshebeth khu galkap lamkaite lah a lien pen ahi a: ama khatvei thu a mi zagiet that pa Eznit mi Adino achipa ukhu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh ama zomin Ahoh mi, Dodo tapa Eleazar ahi, tua mipa pen Philistin mite kidou dinga akikhop khawm lai ua amaleh David in simmaw tahin atawh ua, Israelte anua tai sieng lai ua David kunga galkap hangsan thum umte lah a khat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama adingdoh a, akhut akham a, akhut in namsau atuh thei laisie, Philistin mite asatlia a, tualeh khum niin Mangpa’n nasatahin gal azousah hi. Tualeh mipite khu gallah sumte lading giap in ahing nuakia kia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama zou in Harar mi Agee tapa Shammah ahi. Philistin mite khu be tampi pouna mun khat ah, akikaikhawm ua, tualeh Israelte khu Philistin mite akipat atai zahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hinanleh Shammah in belei laikim tah a dingin, avenga, Philistinte athat a, tualeh Mangpa’n nasatah in azou sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n lamkai lien sawmthumte lah a thumte, bu lah hun laitahin David kungah Adullam leihawm ah apei suh ua, tualeh Philistin galkapten Rephaim phaihawm ah panmun abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khum hunlai tahin David khu kulpi sungah aum a, tualeh Philistin galkapte khu Bethlehem ah aum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh David in “Tui adu mama a, Bethlehem a tuikul a tui, kulpi kotkhah kunga um khu dawn dinga hing pie um le izaw!” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n galkap hangsan thumten Philistin galkapte aphuzah phei ua, kul kotkhah kunga Bethlehem tuikul a tui ava thal ua, David kungah ahing tawi uhi. Hinanleh David in ana dawn nuom sih a, Mangpa kungah abokhe zawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh “Aw Mangpa tami ka dawnlou dingdan, shi ngap a va kuonte sisan hilou ahiei mah?” achi a, tuaziehin David in a dawn nuom sih hi. Tamte mi hangsan thumte sil bawl ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zeruiah tapa Joab sanggampa Abishai khu mi thumte lah a lamkai lienpen ahi. Aman a teipi in mi zathum athat a, tuachi’n thumte lah ah min hoi alaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thumte lah ah ama pahtawi tuoh ahisih a mah? Tuaziehin alamkai dingun abawl uhi, hinanleh tungnung pen thumte lah a sim tel phah ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh Kabzeel mi, mi hangsan Jehoiada tapa Benaiah in sil thupi tahtah tampi abawla, aman Moab galkap minthang humpibahnei bang mai a kigen ni athat a. Tualeh akuon suh a, vua kieh san laitahin lei hawm sunga humpibahnei khat ava that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh Izipt mi, milientah khat athat hi. Izipt mi in teipi khat atawi a, hinanleh aman chieng tawi in ava zuon a, Izipt mipa teipi tawilai ava lahpieh a, ama teipi in ava sunliata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jehoiada tapa Benaiah in tambang silte abawl ziehin mihat leh hangsan thumte lah ah min hoi alaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mihat sawmthumte sanga pahtawi tah zaw ahia, hinanleh mihat leh hangsan thumte lah ah apangpha zou sih hi. Tualeh David in ama vengte lamkai in akoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Joab sanggampa Asahel khu sawmthumte lah a khat ahi. Bethlehem khuo a um Dodo tapa Elhanan;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Harod mi Shammah, Harod mi Elika
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Pal mi Helez, Tekoa mi Ikkesh tapa Ira.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Anathoth mi Abiezer, Hushath mi Mebunnai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ahoh mi Zalmon, Netophath mi Maharai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Netophath mi Baanah tapa Heleb, Benjamin hahlesuonte lah a Gibeah khuo a Ribai tapa Ittai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Pirathon mi Benaiah Gaash luite a hing kipan Hidai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Arbath mi Abi-Albon, Barhum mi Azmaveth,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Shaalbon mi Eliahba, Jashen tapate lah a Jonathan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Harar mi Shammah, Harar mi Sharar tapa Ahiam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Makath mi Ahasbai tapa Eliphelet, Gilon mi Ahithophel tapa Eliam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Karmel mi Hezrai, Arb mi Parai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Zobah khuo a Nathan tapa Igal, Gad mi Bani
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ammon mi Zelek, Beerothmi Nahari, Zeruiah tapa Joab galvan tawipa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ithrimi Ira, Ithrimi Gareb
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Hitmi Uria, abawn un sawmthum leh sagi ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israelte tungah Mangpa alungthah kia a, “Kuon inlen Israel mi leh Juda mite va sim in,” chia atung ua thusie bawl dingin David atohthou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa’n akunga um galkap lamkai Joab kungah, “Israel nam zousie Dan a kipat Beer-Sheba tandong vatuon suoh unlen mi bangza apha uoi chi ka theina dingin va sim in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hinanleh Joab in leengpa kungah, “Mangpa na Pasian in Israel mipite tampi in pungsah henlen ale za a tamzaw in zong pung sah hen, tuachi’n ka pu leengpa’n amit ngei in mu heh. Hinanleh bang dinga kapu leengpa’n tuami thei ut sese ahiei mah?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bangtenghileh leengpa thuin Joab leh galkap lamkai liente azouta a, tuachi’n Joab leh galkap lamkaite Israel galdou thei mipite sim dingin leengpa kunga kipat in apawtkheta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh Jordan gal ava kai ua, tualeh Gad guom lai tah a um Aroer khopi simlam Jazer dong in giehphuol abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n Gilead leh Tahtim Hodshi gam ah apei ua, tualeh Dan-jaan leh Sidon gam kimvel atung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n Tai-ar kulpi lam zuon in apei ua, Hivmite khopi zousie leh Kanaan gam ava tung ua, tuachi’n Juda gam simlam leh Beer-Sheba atung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachia gam pumpi aphah suoh zou un, ha kuo leh ni sawmni abei in, Jerusalem ah ahing nua pei kiata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joab in mi phaza leengpa kungah apie a, Israel gam ah namsau tawi mi hangsan tul za giet a um ua, tualeh Juda mi tul za nga a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />David in galkap mite asim zou in, alungsim ana mama a, tualeh David in Mangpa kungah, “Ka sil bawl ah kana khiel nasa mamata hi. Aw Mangpa na suohpa thulimlouna hing lahmang pieh dingin ka hing ngen hi, aziehpen mothuoi tahin ka bawl khata hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Azing ni zingmawnga David thawmasangin, David guolneipa Gad kungah Mangpa thu ana tunga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pei inlen David kungah, “Mangpa’n tam bangin a gen hi, na tunga ka tun sah ding sil thumte lah ah khat tel in, achi hi,” vachi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n Gad David kungah ava haw a; akungah, “Gamsunga na tungah kum thum kiel tun ding ahiei? ahisihleh ha thum sung na galten ahing nuadel a tai tai ahiei? ahisihleh ni thum sung na gamsunga natna hipi len ahiei? tuin kingaituo inlen, ahing sawlpa bangchibanga dawng ding ka hiei? hing hil in” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh David in Gad kungah, “Ka lung azing mama mai hi, Mangpa khut sungah pualut mai lei, akhotuona lah athupi mama ngal a, mihing khut sungah vang hing pua lut sah vawt sin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n Israel mite tungah ahun guotsa sungteng, natna hipi asawlta a, Dan apat Beersheba tan in mi tul sawm sagi ashi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh Pasian vansawlsieng in suse dinga Jerusalem tunga akhut alaptou laitahin Mangpa’n sil hoilou abawl tup akipat alungsim ahenga, tualeh mipite sumangtu vansawlsieng kungah, “Hunta, na khut zah nawn sin,” achi hi. Tuachi’n Mangpa vansawlsieng khu Jebusmi Araunah phuol kungah a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />David in mite thatgamtu vansawlsieng amu tahin, Mangpa ahoupi a, “Ngai in, ka khielta hi, gitlouhuoi tahin ka bawl khata hi, hinanleh tam belamten bang sil abawl ua ahiei? Na khutin keima leh ka pa innkuonte hing khoi zaw heh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khum niin Gad David kungah ava haw a, akungah, “Peitou inlen Jebus mi Araunah phuol ah Mangpa a dingin maitam khat bawlin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n thu apieh banga, Gad in agen dungzui in David a peitouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Araunah in a et leh, leengpa leh asuohte ama lam zuon a hing pei amu a, tuachi’n Araunah ava pawt a, amai a tuolsuin chibai abuh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n Araunah in akungah, “Bangzieh a kapu leengpa asuohpa kunga, hing haw laizang ahiei?” achi hi. Tuachi’n David in akungah, “Mipite lah a natna hipi leng atawp theina dingin, Mangpa adinga, na phuol lei dinga hing pei ka hi uh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n Araunah in David kungah, “Ka pu leengpa’n kitan henlen, adei bangin lan heh, En in, halmang sillat dingin bawngtalte tanah aum hi, tualeh avan zah dingin phuol van zahte leh bawng vante a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aw leengpa tamte zousie kei Araunah in leengpa ka hing pe sieng hi.” Tualeh Araunah in leengpa kungah, “Mangpa na Pasian in hing pompiehta hen” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa’n Araunah kungah, “Hilou e, aman nei a, alei a ka hing lei pieh mawngmawng ding ahi, bangma senna umlou in Mangpa ka Pasian kungah, halmang sillatte ka lan mawngmawng sih ding hi,” achi hi. Tuachi’n David in phuol leh bawngtalte khu dangka Shekel sawmnga in aleita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh David in Mangpa adingin maitam khat abawl a, tualeh halmang sillat leh lemna sillat alan hi. Tuachi’n Mangpa’n a thumna te adawnga, gam tungah alungdamta a, Israel akipat natna hipi aladohta hi.
  </para>
</usx>
